Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[Subtitles: IdioticBaka1824]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}STARTING SOON\N"Cave Story - Behind the Scenes"\Ntwitter hashtag #uragawa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, then... shall we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks, I'm sure you've all enjoyed some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-That so?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, should we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stand up for this, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sure.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Big crowd, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm hella nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, once again, I'd like to say a few words of introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks, I'd like to thank you all for coming to Cave Story's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,first talk event, "Cave Story - Behind the Scenes".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your host for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ikeya Hayato, a game writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(applause)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.37,0:01:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we have this event's,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,hmm, sponsor? Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakamura, of the company Asterizm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. I'm Nakamura, thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think today's event will be all sorts of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,(applause)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, well, we can't start without calling on our protagonist,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,our protagonist, Amaya-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.56,0:01:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and one more guest, without further ado,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to give them a friendly welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Music!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's give them a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,(applause)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, today's, uh, main guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(it's pretty bright, are you ok?)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.99,0:02:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,is the creator of Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaya-san of Studio Pixel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. I'm Amaya, thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,(applause)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.77,0:02:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more person for today's talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,someone who's very knowledgeable about game development,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,an indie game developer like Amaya-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,we have Naramura-san of Nigoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Naramura here, thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Without further ado, shall we start the toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, how should we do this, guys, can we gokijitsu???
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, everyone...\N-Raise our glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, why toast then, let's gokijitsu???
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sure. Raise your glasses please, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one?\N-Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Would you like anything to drink?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'd like to toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Cheers!\N-Cheeers!\N-Cheeeers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.60,0:03:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,(applause)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sit down, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. Alright, let's have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.63,0:03:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, let's start with Part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.72,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'd like to talk with Amaya-san about the,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:04:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, the development of the project "Cave Story" up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,how it went and what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaya-san, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, to get right into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,About how long has it been since the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,final version of Cave Story released?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, it's been about 6 years. I released it in 2004.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-2004, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Between then and now, it's spread like crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time, I would never have thought it would spread like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-By the way, it was published as a free game in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,About how many times has it been downloaded?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, well, I haven't exactly been counting, but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been put up in various places besides Vector,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: Vector is a software download site.]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've been hosting it on my own site too, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you put them together, well, Vector is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's much more than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So that gives an idea of how much it's been downloaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,about 220,000 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-220,000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-In the beginning, when you first released it, how was the reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it felt like it slowly and steadily built up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't feeling up to polishing the game, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the people who visited my homepage,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,they started spreading it, or should I say, by word of mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, people went on Vector,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and, slowly but surely, started downloading from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of people dropped by on that page,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,sharing their impressions or reporting bugs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, folks in the audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,have you played Cave Story?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who came today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, people who've played Cave Story, could you raise your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much all of them, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-People who've cleared it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-People who've cleared it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a good number, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,on that note,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the True Ending, or Sacred Grounds... how many have cleared that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a lot, haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for clearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then I guess we can talk freely, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.\N-I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a bit worried about spoilers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is a behind-the-scenes event,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's talk about all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, Cave Story is super popular overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So it seems, but how exactly did it spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, so about that, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I... did think about translating it to English,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd been receiving a lot of emails asking about a translation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see. From yuu tao???, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, from fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,who asked if I could translate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I did try, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Making it in English, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, there's a lot of,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just replacing the text,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but the characters, they need to line up exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,which was hard, it was a little discouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,At that point, a person called Shih Tzu reached out, saying he would make
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,an English translation, as opposed to a localisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: I'm still not too sure about the two words he used here.]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-A localisation is different from a translation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. A translation is,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,almost entirely left up to the translator,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There was, well, a group that made, uh, a patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't really have to do anything myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They had a group that did it all on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So I got acquainted with Shih Tzu-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. So this person called Shih Tzu-san did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, it spread overseas,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,which was really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, in Japan, Cave Story is known as a free game,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but overseas, it's been ported to various hardware, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right. Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, the WiiWare,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's a WiiWare port, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes... also the DSi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's on the screen, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, it's on the screen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So this here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,From left to right, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,nan kishibou??? arun desuka ne, kore wa
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here, the first one, that's the original, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-The Windows version.\N-Yes, that's the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-The one in the middle is the Mac version.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mac version... Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-The Mac version, well, I have a friend called Nakiwo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,who,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he developed programs for Mac,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and he said he wanted to make a port,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"I want to program a port", he said, and immediately afterward,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he was like, "I ported it."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-The users (???)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. It was only on Windows,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd resigned myself to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to him, the game spread to Mac users too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's the one on the far right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-The one on the right is, uh, the English version.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, the English version.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-The English version has "Cave Story",
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,written in English on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So the title, logo, and all that was all converted to English, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-So Doukutsu Monogatari is known overseas as "Cave Story", is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, "Cave Story".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kinda-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-kinda literal, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Next, the first on the bottom right, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks kinda, polygon-ish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is from the 3DS.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-About how much longer will it be for the 3DS release overseas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, I think it should be this month...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.00,0:09:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Next week, right? I think it was... November 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. And this one here is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the WiiWare version.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes. For the upgraded visuals,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the graphics were drawn in double [resolution],
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what happened in the WiiWare version.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-So the graphics were edited...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-The graphics, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The soundtrack was, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it was remixed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the soundtrack is different too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a professional was doing the remixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, the Mac port, and the English version, and such,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fell in the free category, which isn't surprising...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:09:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was surprised that the WiiWare and 3DS versions
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,were commercial releases, that was quite the shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what has your release schedule been like since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, let's see. Cave Story is, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of players, and the fans are increasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then I've worked on some minigames, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have been busy, and haven't been able to do much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"so right now, I can't release anything, please be patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"let me recover my strength," is what it was like... But,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,around then, Tyrone Rodriguez of Nicalis,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.19,0:10:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-The president of "Nicalis"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. So I heard from Tyrone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,via email,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that he wanted to make a mobile port of Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And that he'd ported Yie Ar Kung-Fu to mobile already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,By mobile, you mean mobile phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, mobile phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mobile phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought, an action game like this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,on a mobile phone? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wondered, what sort of person are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was busy at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and it looked like he could do it if I left it up to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so I let him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Having given him approval, I was wondering what would happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I didn't hear from him at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh? Even though he suggested it first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought, "I guess that's just how it is,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and I gave up on the mobile, and then came the GameBoy Advance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you gave up on the mobile port?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, I guess I gave up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...is what I thought at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-the GameBoy Advance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I didn't really mind that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,With the DS and Wii thing after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-It kept climbing higher, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! Bit by bit, kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was almost like a dream, you could say...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, such ??? - On the contrary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought doing something like that was impossible, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been a few years since, but finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it came out on WiiWare overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So about the WiiWare release, this Tyrone-san from Nicalis,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,he handled all of that himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaya-san, you're not really the sort of person who can depend on others, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, well... Actually, that's how it was at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, all this going back and forth, I didn't really like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.54,0:12:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, right, the WiiWare sprites were redrawn, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. So there, in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a lot of this and that to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,a bunch of stuff popping up they'd ask me to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and such - I couldn't do all of it ???
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...that's how it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,jihoku??? kosoku kara iro iro kakawari nagara shigoto ??? koto de
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Speaking of which, the 3DS version is releasing soon overseas,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but what sort of commercial release did Cave Story see over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:13:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-So about that... WiiWare de tsukutteruyo to itteru koro kara desu ne ichiyou
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The 3D modeling and such, when it came to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the modeling ??? since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. So, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this was games, not work - that sort of an atmosphere, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but eventually, I guess it was like, I'm not making decisions on my own, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So things like that happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, really, what would it look like in 3D...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hardly even imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, nanda kanda to itte, konyou ni... ???
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,peace, chokusen made (i)kite shimatta to iu de ???
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.70,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, there's a lot of hype and interest overseas, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou iu toku ni shougyou katte iu tokoro ni kanjite ireba ???
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right. Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There were things I left up to hyousou??? Nicalis - to Tyrone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I heard we'd be releasing the WiiWare in Japan too,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but when it comes to releasing it in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to have someone here running things,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was a salaryman, see,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and I couldn't let this private hobby get out of hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought, no choice but to give up on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so for overseas, you left it up to Nicalis, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Domestically, izaa tte koto ni naru to???, you'd need someone here again to run things?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, I couldn't get that done, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, from looking at Twitter, the PSP version is unofficial, as I understand it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was ported by a volunteer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, quite a few friends have played it on PSP, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-When I first saw it I was like, wow, it runs on the PSP! I was deeply moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it's true that it's not official...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The official ones are the Mac and the Wii, and the DS.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Apart from the PSP, there also seems to be a version that runs on Linux.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I've never seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-hontou nono??? haado de ja ima asoberun desu ne
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this old hardware I haven't heard of before,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckle]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a mail from someone asking me to port to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's that...\NWhat was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was it a "demake"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um, let's see... Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been a demake, a port to something...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it a Commodore?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, Commodore six four?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Commodore sixty-four? Hehe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Old and nostalgic hardware is super popular overseas, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, hardware that didn't come out in Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh? They did come out in Japan though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-At least the ??? did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lots of enthusiasts for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, they don't run, do they? I haven't heard of that happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, there's a lot of unique sound chips and such that are only growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it would be nice to see Cave Story's music remade on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, sorry, I'm getting a little too into it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, on that note, if you go on Twitter right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you see a lot of people going "It would be nice if it released in Japan,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:15:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-So they are. Yes, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I see requests like that on my BBS from time to time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't really say much beyond "I'll do my best."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.61,0:16:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's just check in on Niconico Live a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, they're broadcasting this, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-You alright? You seem out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, it's loaded?\N-Yay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-How many people are watching right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's two... two thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-...and three hundred, about?
Comment: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: The NND recording shows 14,814 viewers at this point. So, I'm not sure what they mean here.]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-azuttoru kana???
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-konna fuu ni zutterunda bokura???
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you're right. [waves]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]\N-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,demo ugotte toki masu ???
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-are? ugoitehen???
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-The comments all seem like tsukuri utsutsu???, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, it's lagging a bit. It was scrolling just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:16:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, it's back. They're waving to us from the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:16:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-It looks like the total number of watchers right now is about 2,300... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh, yes, looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the comments are... overwhelming...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really looks like everyone loves Cave Story, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes... Thank you very much, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Niconico Live toka demo ima yatteru hito kekkou imasu mon ne?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, recently there have been people making videos of themselves playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and considering this event could happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering what the players are really thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried watching some last week,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was kinda, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the game, so I know, but first-time players...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know where to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,eien tokoro roshite to mite igai dakara desu???
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]\N[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gets you worked up, right? Like, "C'mon, go here!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... I guess that part could be trouble, is what I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, when I played Cave Story for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought, man, if I ever meet the dev,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to give him a talking-to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, come on, why'd they have to make it so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,shou dekikai na nima iro toki kou ka na to omounde ite mimasu kowainde???
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,ittai masu yo, hai???
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, on Niconico lately, if you search for videos,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.12,0:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a lot of these "Tool Assisted Speedruns".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.65,0:18:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right, on the Time Attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-They use tools to achieve frighteningly fast results on the Time Attack, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,toka no douga mo attari shite, himata??? chotto mori agatteru you na
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. Well, players recently-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.57,0:18:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until now, I haven't made much use of Twitter or such, but when I go and look,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like there's a lot of people who know about it but haven't played yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a steady increase in people thinking, "I'll play it now,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: Windows Forest is a software download site.]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,On Windows Forest, the number of downloads by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-By now? Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,seem to have reached first place, in the games section.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for your support.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-de ma koette osarai shite miru to,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,overseas, there's been a lot of releases, like for the WiiWare or the 3DS,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but none domestically, despite the original developer being from here - we're lagging behind, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right? It's like...\N-Domestically, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, there was the Mac version, but that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-nanka sorosoro???
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,kokunai tenkai mitai nano ga???
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-ne, nanka ??? saretemasu kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-[inaudible]???
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Amaya-san, will Cave Story not release in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-U-um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like... like, oh, it's in my pocket now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.78,0:19:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh, now, there's something interesting to show you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's like, an announcement, an important announcement related to the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that's right, an announcement for the official site...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Awesome. kore wa to ika ni motte??? masu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-choppa ne???
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, let's zoom in the camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, can we see what's being revealed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.99,0:19:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um, uh, first...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:19:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is the sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is the ??? good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.71,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hang on a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, please broadcast this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, without further ado, shall we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-A video, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll be displaying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, please enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.43,0:21:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whew, am I excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well? Whaddaya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-In the end there we saw Asterizm being mentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's where Nakamura-san comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. Nakamura-san, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh, well, so it's like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.79,0:21:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the topic of a release came up at our company,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and this was brought up by Naramura, a while ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so I think he can tell us more about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh?\N-So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:21:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-We've been discussing with Amaya-san consistently about this for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the WiiWare, and the DSi version, we'd like to release it in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but in Japan, there's no place we can release it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the situation is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we entered the WiiWare market too,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and tried our best, and soon, when the finish line seemed in sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,nihon de urun??? dattara,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,from their side, that is, from Nicalis' side,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.27,0:22:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the overseas version, the WiiWare version, it was Nicalis who released that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So with that, well, for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.44,0:22:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it looked like we wouldn't be able to release it in Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.81,0:22:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.64,0:22:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The WiiWare or the DSi version? - there was the issue of which one to release.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And there, since the WiiWare version's release,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a year or so after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.42,0:22:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and during the revision phase, on Amaya-san's site-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we had a survey put up...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.81,0:22:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though people wouldn't know about it, other than those visiting my site.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So anyways, after the survey was fielded,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.49,0:22:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,all together, there were about 2000 emails...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wow, that's one heck of a pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-True...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,mada ima demo kite kureru hito minna??? My homepage wasn't updated at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.53,0:23:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And in there, the DSi was overwhelmingly in favour,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so it was like, okay, let's narrow the discussion to making a DSi port.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Speaking of the DSi, well, Nintendo is launching the 3DS soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,can it be played here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.04,0:23:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, right. Download???
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-ichiban meniitto??? kanaa to omoun desu yo ne?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.99,0:23:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, um, now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-What you were about to show earlier but didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.38,0:23:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-You wanted to do it a bit more Jobs-like, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, Steve Jobs, haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-So anyways, speaking of which, I have this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, like it's in your pocket, haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, uh so, chotto eru eru nanke???
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.78,0:23:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-C'mon, let's do this again, stand up and pull it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.60,0:23:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.42,0:23:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Jobs-like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.95,0:23:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.75,0:23:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, folks, let's show some excitement. That ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.83,0:23:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-[whistling]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.49,0:23:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, something in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:23:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is that?\NHmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.98,0:24:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, indeed? Let's have a little look-see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.21,0:24:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-[clapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry, haha. Uh, akanzetto???
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. Can we display it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.66,0:24:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, hmm, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.02,0:24:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Only the sound is audible?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.79,0:24:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, it's not loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.71,0:24:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Try going to the settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.23,0:24:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.03,0:24:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.12,0:24:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it running?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.67,0:24:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, plugged in the sound, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.93,0:24:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, umm, the PC-
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.83,0:24:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:24:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, audio's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.41,0:24:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just working.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.11,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are you hearing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well folks, until the camera is focused, just enjoy the sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.61,0:25:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.72,0:25:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, Amaya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.41,0:25:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.22,0:25:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-So... Who's playing? May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.64,0:25:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I play?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.93,0:25:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Alright, let's switch seats...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.27,0:25:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.32,0:25:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.18,0:25:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Ikeya-san, please go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, let's go! Is Story Mode fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.03,0:25:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, without further ado...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.37,0:25:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're starting at Arthur's House...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, okay, we'll see the Egg Corridor if you continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.00,0:25:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. This is fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.29,0:25:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah. Well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.46,0:25:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're starting from midway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-The LR buttons are for switching weapons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.49,0:26:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Can we switch to the lower screen too?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's used for some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-The map is displayed on the lower screen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.44,0:26:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.23,0:26:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, there it is. So that's how the screens are divided, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.27,0:26:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm really happy that it's running properly on the DSi, not just emulation or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.27,0:26:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this basically a perfect port of the PC version?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.06,0:26:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, it's quite faithful to the PC version. Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.71,0:26:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something new called a Jukebox,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.09,0:27:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,where if you've heard a song once, you can select it from the title screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.94,0:27:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, while this isn't a major change,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.06,0:27:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a setting you can change,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.93,0:27:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and people who found the PC version too difficult to clear
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.44,0:27:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,can now select "Easy Mode", and hopefully, clear the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.20,0:27:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Dialogue and such appears on the lower screen, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.43,0:27:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, since it's on the lower screen, it won't obscure the gameplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, let's keep going...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.74,0:27:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.28,0:27:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, do some commentary...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.84,0:27:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.87,0:27:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry, yeah, that would be funny. I was just playing normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.04,0:27:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.87,0:27:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.02,0:27:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, what exactly changes when you adjust the difficulty?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, true, I'm curious about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.99,0:27:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Difficulty adjustment? Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.26,0:27:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At first... Well, the person who was working on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:27:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.28,0:28:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ultimately, it got difficult for them to coordinate with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.83,0:28:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried to make it as simple as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.64,0:28:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.52,0:28:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I made Ikachan before this, I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.32,0:28:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.56,0:28:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"It's no good trying to work together with me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.75,0:28:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, in the DSi version, if you start on Easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.41,0:28:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,someone like me would be able to clear the First Cave without dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.46,0:28:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah!\N-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.19,0:28:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, dying there is almost standard, but now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.46,0:28:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.64,0:28:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, just once,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.02,0:28:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.93,0:28:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, so it's not instant death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.81,0:28:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's not instant death, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-ima wa ??? desuyo ne? naido rafu??? na toki dake desuyo ne?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.02,0:28:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.19,0:28:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When you change difficulty, the protagonist's colour changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, the protagonist's colour is different?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. Based on a young chicken, he was coloured yellow,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.83,0:28:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.76,0:28:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yellow, like a chick, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.94,0:28:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.72,0:28:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.13,0:28:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Could you show us in detail after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.10,0:28:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, sure, let's look at it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-On the other hand, can the difficulty be increased?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.80,0:29:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-On increased difficulty, let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.38,0:29:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,your HP is drastically reduced, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.61,0:29:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,there's essentially no scope to increase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.92,0:29:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.13,0:29:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And the protagonist's colour, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,well, like a human's. Flesh-coloured.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.85,0:29:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.57,0:29:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.63,0:29:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And the clothes are light blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.72,0:29:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-kore futsuu ni nanka sonzai masu ne???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.01,0:29:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-No plans of beating it, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.36,0:29:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.35,0:29:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.59,0:29:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.39,0:29:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.51,0:29:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikeya, you're hogging all the fun, that's no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.68,0:29:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.74,0:29:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.46,0:29:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right? I want a turn too. So, please die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Please die", haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-You want me to die??
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.52,0:29:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-shinde koro no kono game desu kara ne???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do I see people getting up to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.75,0:29:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.47,0:29:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.35,0:29:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Instakill locations are important.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.59,0:29:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.61,0:29:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Instakill locations are important?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, it's designed to keep you on edge...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.09,0:30:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lotsa places you can die instantly, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.67,0:30:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. I put one in almost every stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.91,0:30:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.55,0:30:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-And if you play on Easy Mode,\Nsome of these will leave you alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, like this one we saw here? That's right, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL Note: Basil is not survivable even in Easy Mode. I may be misinterpreting this dialogue.]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.70,0:30:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.44,0:30:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-You can pass through there, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.17,0:30:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's not like in Super Mario where you can fall off-screen and die,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.77,0:30:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,so in place of the falling-off, I designed such instakill locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.93,0:30:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.92,0:30:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, about this title screen...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.72,0:30:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, so what we see here is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.18,0:30:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there are three save slots here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's one difference from the PC version.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.48,0:30:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.50,0:30:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm going back, that ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.31,0:30:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, is that ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.43,0:30:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-This, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:31:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Story Mode\N-Arthur's House\N-New Game\N-Jenka's House\NDelete Save Data
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.48,0:30:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one, right? The third.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:30:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.00,0:30:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.44,0:30:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.78,0:31:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.66,0:31:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.11,0:31:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.27,0:31:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.34,0:31:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.09,0:31:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, no. Uh, so it's not a copy,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.78,0:31:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.16,0:31:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-ah de sankai, eh, mitsumete wake hodo dekimasu yo to???
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.39,0:31:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, three is more fun than one, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.55,0:31:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.77,0:31:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-The savedata in the third slot we saw earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.96,0:31:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}-Easy Mode\N-Normal Mode\N-Hard Mode
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.89,0:31:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, the protagonist's colour is different here, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.63,0:31:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, this is where you can select...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is what you were referring to, the yellow colour of a chick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.87,0:31:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.28,0:31:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that's Normal, and that's Hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, Hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.07,0:31:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm curious about what's different in Hard Mode, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.69,0:31:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hard Mode, well, your starting HP is really low...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.32,0:31:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so all but surviving is pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-So it's basically just low HP?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.25,0:31:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, low HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.49,0:31:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard that I can't clear it myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.49,0:31:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.82,0:32:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but really, among overseas players, and Japanese players,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.28,0:32:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,there are people who've played the game with 3 HP, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.59,0:32:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-I suppose that was in an informal self-imposed challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.48,0:32:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.61,0:32:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's a proper mode for such people now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.21,0:32:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.41,0:32:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}-Story Mode\N-???\N-Jukebox\N-Help
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.30,0:32:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-So next there's this, and this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.66,0:32:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.79,0:32:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's a bunch of question marks here...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.11,0:32:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...guess we'll check it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? sou desu ne
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.43,0:32:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? shimashouka
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.71,0:32:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, let's check out the Jukebox.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.14,0:32:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.70,0:32:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-So here, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.29,0:32:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Songs that you hear in-game gather here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.38,0:32:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and you can listen to them whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.99,0:32:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-So once you listen to it in-game, it unlocks here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.21,0:32:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, one by one, they're struck off...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.69,0:32:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but ???
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.09,0:32:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see, ???
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.52,0:32:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, there's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-The icons are a little... chaotic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.92,0:32:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.75,0:32:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, well, we tried making icons featuring scenes where that song generally plays...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.02,0:32:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-dou to katte arimasu yo???
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.01,0:32:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, this is the title screen, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-This?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.40,0:33:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.36,0:33:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Main Theme, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.71,0:33:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, from the title screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, this is the computer...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.98,0:33:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Access".
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.20,0:33:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.33,0:33:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So... I've been curious, what's this that's not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.26,0:33:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.35,0:33:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.61,0:33:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Secret.\N-It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.48,0:33:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.95,0:33:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.16,0:33:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.47,0:33:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.32,0:33:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.95,0:33:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Man, so it's really out on the DSi, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.02,0:33:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-It really had us all waiting, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.07,0:33:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, it's finally here...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.60,0:33:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Umm,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.19,0:33:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw the announcement earlier about the DSi release,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so... the price is, uh, 1000 points, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.56,0:33:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Annou-
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.29,0:33:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-1000, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So... it's selling for 1000 points overseas,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.84,0:33:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was wondering if 1000 points would be an appropriate price for Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.48,0:33:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhm, Nintendo cards, they start at... 1000 yen, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.38,0:33:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,2000 yen, 2 or 3000 toka nande???
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.76,0:33:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.39,0:34:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.35,0:34:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 1,100 points, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.03,0:34:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gonna receive backlash from users, right? kiri ga warui to???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.39,0:34:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.80,0:34:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,de, ma sono hansen wa atte???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.36,0:34:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.04,0:34:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.33,0:34:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-ama ni desu yo ne???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.04,0:34:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame. ???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.91,0:34:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.40,0:34:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.37,0:34:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.96,0:34:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-sou iu hassou desu ne???
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.98,0:34:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.29,0:34:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Also, I'm curious about "Release B"...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.74,0:34:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.92,0:34:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.75,0:34:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.20,0:34:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-After a few more announcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.40,0:34:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.28,0:34:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.76,0:34:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's just, there's a video called "Coming Soon",
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.58,0:34:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.11,0:34:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and right after that will be Release B.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.57,0:34:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to do a review that explains more about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.74,0:34:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.64,0:34:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this "Coming Soon" video really urgent?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.96,0:34:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.49,0:34:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhm, so "Coming Soon" can mean various things...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.04,0:34:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.76,0:34:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-And what might those be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.83,0:34:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.32,0:34:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-are, tsuruki kashite itadaki mashou ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.73,0:35:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright then, let's be sensible about this "Coming Soon" business. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.18,0:35:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.40,0:35:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.48,0:35:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we got a video letter from Tyrone of Nicalis, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.60,0:35:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, it's here. Hang on a minute, let's get this ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.28,0:35:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sure.\N-Ah, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.32,0:35:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, can you introduce this guy to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.04,0:35:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, um, so this guy is called Tyrone, and until recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.19,0:35:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-You mentioned this earlier, but he's the guy who
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.52,0:35:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,published Cave Story overseas, right?\N\h
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.09,0:35:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's not just Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.88,0:35:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,they keep an eye out for any interesting freeware,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.87,0:35:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and publish and advertise them to consumers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.90,0:35:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, so it's not just Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,they've uncovered more fun games?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.89,0:35:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they find hidden gems and publish them to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.35,0:35:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, they publish...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.59,0:35:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.64,0:35:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, so the DSi, until its announcement, until its release...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.63,0:35:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Overseas, there's a lot of interesting DSiWare that came out,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.68,0:35:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,that didn't release in Japan. And this, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.43,0:35:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the video's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.52,0:36:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.24,0:36:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This was actually only just received, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.60,0:36:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Only just received, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This really just came in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.43,0:36:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just came in...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.05,0:36:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Amazing timing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.81,0:36:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh, I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.06,0:36:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Tyrone, Tyrone Rodriguez...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.77,0:36:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.58,0:36:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.66,0:36:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,ma konna shuu??? desu
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.83,0:36:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, he seems like a fairly good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Fairly" good guy??
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.20,0:36:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really good guy, I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.24,0:36:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. [laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.47,0:36:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyrone's not around, watching, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.44,0:36:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna get yelled at!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.42,0:36:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.17,0:36:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.89,0:36:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, are we good to play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.54,0:36:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.31,0:36:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay then, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.33,0:36:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, sound isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.48,0:36:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's so like Tyrone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.63,0:36:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry, could you work the sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aight, from the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.79,0:36:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's saying something really cool... but we can't hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.86,0:36:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, not this, not this. Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.47,0:36:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.19,0:36:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound should be fine. It's this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.48,0:36:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, once again, let's redo this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:36:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha, let's redo this, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.42,0:37:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.02,0:37:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, this is a video letter from Tyrone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.23,0:37:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.92,0:37:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.25,0:37:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this was just received?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.27,0:37:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-This just came in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.88,0:37:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-It just came in!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.93,0:37:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-No sound again??
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.15,0:37:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.57,0:37:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Aw maannn...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.03,0:37:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're trying again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.71,0:37:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.65,0:37:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-kore, naramura san, chotto yonde moratte ii desu ka???
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.04,0:37:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-???
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.21,0:37:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-yobe nain desuka???
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.95,0:37:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Different line?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.68,0:37:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.02,0:37:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.02,0:37:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-This PC's line?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.05,0:37:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-The camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.26,0:37:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...the camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-This thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.13,0:37:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.01,0:37:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.92,0:37:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.35,0:37:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, third time's the charm...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.31,0:37:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.24,0:37:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.61,0:37:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, we have a video letter from Tyrone...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.53,0:37:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.88,0:37:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.09,0:37:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.12,0:37:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.61,0:37:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it! Man, was that silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.33,0:37:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.44,0:37:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.44,0:37:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.33,0:38:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, and this letter just arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.74,0:38:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.49,0:38:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-It just came?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.32,0:38:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It just came!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.11,0:38:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.41,0:38:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.00,0:38:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.94,0:38:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Tyrone Rodriguez, from Nicalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.73,0:38:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,People of Japan, greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been working with Studio Pixel since 2007,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.93,0:38:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and with Nigoro since 2008.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.16,0:38:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of work, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.16,0:38:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Under Amaya-san's supervision,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.25,0:38:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I ported Cave Story to WiiWare and DSiWare,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.94,0:38:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and am working on a 3DS port.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.69,0:38:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I should say to you people of Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.68,0:38:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.89,0:38:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry it's taking so long to release it in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.96,0:38:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to release the WiiWare version in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.44,0:38:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I had many thoughts, but thanks to you fans' comments, I decided to release a DSiWare version.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.52,0:38:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This way you can play it on the 3DS too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.72,0:38:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Collaborating with the Nigoro guys, we'll be able to release it in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.64,0:38:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The land where Cave Story was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.73,0:38:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.73,0:38:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: His dub says "Japan" here instead of the usual endonym "Nihon" for some reason.]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.04,0:38:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.12,0:38:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.35,0:39:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you want to know why Amaya-san's game has been getting attention from players worldwide?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is because Amaya-san's latest, Cave Story, is a supremely charming game.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.88,0:39:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is most unfortunate that I could not get to be Cave Story's developer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Truly, it is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, he once said:
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.11,0:39:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Having my game be released all game-like is like a dream come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.21,0:39:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, getting to work with a cool guy like Amaya-san is like a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.08,0:39:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I just want to jump out of this screen and reach over there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please invite me too next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.51,0:39:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you guys, who are so darn excited about my beloved Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.84,0:39:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who will be next to show me the best game ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.90,0:39:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Heheh, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.69,0:39:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.40,0:40:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.76,0:40:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-That was Tyrone Rodriguez.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.88,0:40:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-What {\i1}was{\i0} that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.30,0:40:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-By the way, this video just came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.17,0:40:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just came in, right? They even took care of editing in captions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.48,0:40:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-By... the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.95,0:40:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There were some mistakes, right? Here and there...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.77,0:40:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, so, Japanese isn't his forte, I guess, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.04,0:40:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,his accent was kinda funny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.67,0:40:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.52,0:40:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,ano, ??? kaigai no tsuuhan bangou mitai yatsu???
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.94,0:40:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.40,0:40:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That sort of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.59,0:40:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I do think he was doing his best to speak well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.67,0:40:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.26,0:40:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,tte koto ni shokimashou yo???
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.80,0:40:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Still, the guy who captioned it was a little evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.45,0:40:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.85,0:40:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Must've been an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.38,0:40:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but yeah, it was a great video honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.37,0:40:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tyrone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.40,0:40:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then. This marks the end of Part 1, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.28,0:40:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.69,0:40:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.59,0:40:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been Part 1: Cave Story Up Until Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.17,0:40:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we'll have a brief intermission, before we continue with Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, so... 10 minutes should be good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.28,0:41:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.92,0:41:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. So we'll break for 10 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.91,0:41:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,right now it's... 13:10, so let us start Part 2 at... 13:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.60,0:41:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Ah, by the way, there's a notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.60,0:41:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is about the drinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it looks like the drink "Curly" has sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.28,0:41:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.87,0:41:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.96,0:41:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Curly" really is popular, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.66,0:41:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Seems like it, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.56,0:41:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Also, the results of the popularity poll will be announced later, so look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.60,0:41:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, coming to food...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.72,0:41:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, the yellow triangular item, I'm not sure what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.16,0:41:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it appears to have sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.70,0:41:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: According to the menu, it was samosa.]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.16,0:41:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, there's still plenty of "Mimiga".
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.24,0:41:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With that said, those who haven't tried it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.24,0:41:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,more should be in stock soon for you to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.24,0:41:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Can't level up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.47,0:41:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhm,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.71,0:41:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha, yeah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.78,0:41:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-I didn't have the yellow item...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.84,0:41:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't eat it, in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.14,0:41:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Amaya-san, you didn't have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.88,0:41:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.53,0:41:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Aw, that's too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.60,0:41:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.08,0:41:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So with that, let's have a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.76,0:41:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks, please return at 13:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.23,0:42:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.56,0:42:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thanks for sticking around.\N-Thank you for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.87,0:52:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[INTERVAL]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.79,0:52:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, it's time... Let us get started with Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.16,0:52:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Nakamura-san went?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.73,0:52:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh... he's late...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.23,0:52:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If Nakamura-san's not here, who'll handle the slides?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.64,0:52:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakamura-saann!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.92,0:52:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The bathroom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.95,0:52:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How cruel to abandon us...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.96,0:52:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, before we start,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.25,0:52:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, there's something on the whiteboard over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.12,0:52:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.92,0:52:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nakamura-san's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.21,0:52:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.84,0:52:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-I kinda wasn't thinking he'd come at such a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.28,0:52:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,While we were waiting, I felt like, getting kinda restless...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.44,0:52:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-I was wondering what you were doing over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.20,0:53:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you were doodling away, and before I knew it, this drawing showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.36,0:53:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,, -So instead of leaving, to relax, you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.14,0:53:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.91,0:53:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew something, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.60,0:53:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Naramura - La-Mulana's Naramura beside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.93,0:53:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,he wanted me to draw something...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.02,0:53:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-The guy on the left is kinda weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.66,0:53:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, true, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.01,0:53:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.05,0:53:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm betting there's a lot of people who don't recognise the characters on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.02,0:53:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's a critter, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.04,0:53:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.08,0:53:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's a critter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.31,0:53:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.56,0:53:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.96,0:53:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's how it is in the sprite, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.68,0:53:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... If you look closely, it's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.73,0:53:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,if you move closer, it probably starts to look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.56,0:53:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.45,0:53:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.04,0:53:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's take a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.53,0:53:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.45,0:53:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There were some people wanting to take pictures earlier too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.88,0:53:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-I didn't think it'd be on display like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.41,0:53:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.80,0:53:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.39,0:53:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakamura-san, let's take a quick look at what's going on in Niconico Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.90,0:53:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes sir. Please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.18,0:53:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's busy in there, seems like.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:53:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-e, mou, naremashita???
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.04,0:54:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-tentekomai nano ni naremashita?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.18,0:54:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.75,0:54:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-ka kojitsuitari???
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.78,0:54:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.37,0:54:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trending on Twitter too, thanks to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.27,0:54:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's kinda flaming Tyrone's video letter, in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.71,0:54:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.51,0:54:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, back to Niconico Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.22,0:54:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, Niconico Live is on screen now, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.80,0:54:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,uhh, the live viewers are at...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.58,0:54:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...nearly 6,000 now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.72,0:54:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah, that's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.00,0:54:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? That's a lot more than earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Should we do introductions again?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.60,0:54:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.42,0:54:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.04,0:54:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.59,0:54:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.42,0:54:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.70,0:54:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was that even an introduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.28,0:54:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Wii, please", a commenter says...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.34,0:54:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.76,0:54:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.88,0:54:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right? Everyone loves Balrog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.02,0:54:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.15,0:54:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? Oh, cool, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.96,0:54:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the thing with Niconico Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.24,0:54:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this call-and-response that happens over text.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.84,0:54:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.92,0:54:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.92,0:54:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so with that, onto Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.49,0:54:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.54,0:54:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.64,0:54:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.14,0:54:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.97,0:55:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, for Part 2, we'll have an additional guest, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.64,0:55:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.58,0:55:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The developer of Cave Story is... well,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.56,0:55:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the person who developed it is Amaya-san, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.20,0:55:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for various little things, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.84,0:55:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Various people, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.17,0:55:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,helped me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.36,0:55:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,during completion. And one of those people,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.01,0:55:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,called Kuroihito, is...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.92,0:55:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.00,0:55:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.13,0:55:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, the name Kuroihito that was in the credits,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.13,0:55:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: Kuroihito now goes by "room_909".]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.80,0:55:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.43,0:55:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that is, Miyazawa-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.22,0:55:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,today - well, the camera's not pointed at him, he's over here though,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.17,0:55:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,please, come up on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.92,0:55:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a hand, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.17,0:55:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.93,0:55:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please come up on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.29,0:55:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, people, let's hear some applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.16,0:55:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.84,0:55:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, for Part 2, we've invited Miyazawa-san as a guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.22,0:55:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to discuss how Cave Story was developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.06,0:55:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's in the title, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.71,0:55:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,"Cave Story - Behind the Scenes".
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.72,0:55:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.27,0:55:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.84,0:55:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.77,0:55:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. With that said,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:55:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.55,0:56:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,from this point on, these three here will talk freely, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.04,0:56:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-With Amaya-san at the centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.77,0:56:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.17,0:56:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-With Amaya-san at the centre, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.06,0:56:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um-
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.89,0:56:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.35,0:56:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-So to start with...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.08,0:56:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.99,0:56:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you tell us about the time during which you were developing Cave Story?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.44,0:56:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-The development period, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.36,0:56:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Development time, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.17,0:56:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Before completing Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.96,0:56:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a one-year 'brush-up' period,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.20,0:56:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was thinking of finding someone to help with debugging...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.27,0:56:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked about four people to help, and made a private bulletin board,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.71,0:56:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,where we could post bug reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.92,0:56:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And over there, well, the plan was to look at a bug, fix it, and that would be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.89,0:56:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.25,0:56:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But after they were called and started playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,they started making various requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.12,0:56:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, responding to these requests... I found a year had passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.12,0:56:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Miyazawa-san, were you... futori??? datta tte koto desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.39,0:56:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.16,0:57:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, he lent a hand with various things, working alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.69,0:57:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.09,0:57:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-What sort of things, for example...?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.38,0:57:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-At first, bug checking mostly took the form of proofreading text.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.89,0:57:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, fixing punctuation marks,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.51,0:57:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.31,0:57:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.61,0:57:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-There was a lot of that, gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.93,0:57:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.69,0:57:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we knew it though, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.61,0:57:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Isn't this weapon a little too weak?",
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.12,0:57:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,or, say,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.16,0:57:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"If this breaks, it's definitely way too harsh"-
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.63,0:57:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we slowly started raising points about stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.73,0:57:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, behind the scenes, we made use of a BBS,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.73,0:57:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: BBS = Bulletin Board System]
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.17,0:57:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,a BBS for the bug checkers, the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.12,0:57:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The staff there consisted of... four people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.72,0:57:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.55,0:57:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.81,0:57:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We would all talk about the beta version, exchanging mails continuously.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.49,0:57:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's where the final difficult stage, "Sacred Grounds", was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.09,0:57:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.43,0:57:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't there at first?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.39,0:57:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-The route where you drain Curly Brace and all that wasn't there at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.84,0:57:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.48,0:57:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Make an ending where you can save her", and "Make a more difficult stage"...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.60,0:58:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Heck of a request, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.10,0:58:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, no, it was fun for us to discuss this dungeon with everyone and play it,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.12,0:58:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, we were like, "Yippee"...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.52,0:58:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And talking about it was fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.00,0:58:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.93,0:58:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fun, so I thought, "Hey, let's do this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.97,0:58:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd go home, and when I was alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.92,0:58:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.17,0:58:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,when I was alone, I'd work on making a new stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.84,0:58:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-We did kind of just request it and then not elaborate...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.10,0:58:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-But after all, if it weren't for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.90,0:58:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,making a stage like Sacred Grounds where people would be making videos of their speedruns,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.76,0:58:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,y'know, thanks to that... that was the first time I found myself holding my breath so hard, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.75,0:58:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-So after that, Miyazawa-san suggested making additions in the brush-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.11,0:58:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.14,0:58:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-On the screen right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.27,0:58:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you can see a bunch of little windows...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.84,0:58:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes. Those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.92,0:58:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, up until making Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.41,0:58:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.17,0:58:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at these, I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.83,0:58:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a bunch of little things...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.72,0:58:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Ikachan-
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.81,0:58:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I made Ikachan before Cave Story, right? To, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.66,0:59:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,acquire the know-how needed for Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.26,0:59:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.82,0:59:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikachan was what you made right before Cave Story, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.92,0:59:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, I made Ikachan all formulaic. Before Ikachan, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.87,0:59:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a program on the, uh, bottom here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.72,0:59:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You see the flesh-coloured guy there?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.50,0:59:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Flesh-coloured guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.73,0:59:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In the middle, the... brown-coloured guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.92,0:59:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.36,0:59:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-This?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.52,0:59:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.08,0:59:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.53,0:59:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So about that... It was actually before Ikachan,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.76,0:59:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but I made him as part of "Cave Story"...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.44,0:59:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-You made him as part of Cave Story, before Ikachan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.09,0:59:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. I said earlier that Cave Story took 5 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.71,0:59:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but when you include this, it was more like 6 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.47,0:59:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huuuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.91,0:59:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-The other day, he went rummaging through his diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.89,0:59:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So like that-
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.24,0:59:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.98,0:59:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And uhh, he-
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.17,0:59:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.88,0:59:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried I wouldn't have enough material for the event...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.13,0:59:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-He brought along an MO disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.94,0:59:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-MO, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.13,0:59:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: MO = Magneto-Optical.]
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.40,0:59:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was like, he was desperately salvaging any data he could find...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.23,0:59:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.98,0:59:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.19,0:59:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-yoku ebou??? wo yomemashita ne
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.29,0:59:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,sou nan desu yo. mou kowarekake mo ???
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.57,0:59:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, I'd given up on that, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.23,1:00:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.77,1:00:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like, "Huh?" And before you knew it, 6 years had already passed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.76,1:00:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? janai zo
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.08,1:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-So,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.70,1:00:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept a diary?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.01,1:00:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-He did.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.38,1:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.28,1:00:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I started maintaining a diary around the same time I was practicing typing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.24,1:00:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not at all the case today, but back then,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.67,1:00:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd kinda just lazily write about how that day passed,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.43,1:00:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,so yeah, there was that diary, and... right, various-
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.40,1:00:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Must've made a whole lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.02,1:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There were many, but pretty much none of them were really complete, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.96,1:00:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Working on a game is simple enough, but bringing it to completion is where it really gets tough...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.18,1:00:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So here you can see this whole crowd of those failu- those incomplete games.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.61,1:00:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-So what sort of games were these actually? Could you give us an explanation?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.31,1:00:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.88,1:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,they're pretty short, and um,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.78,1:00:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-No like, can you actually show us?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.62,1:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.18,1:00:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we have enough time, I could... connect it here and run it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.13,1:00:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.20,1:00:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-You can show us?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.08,1:00:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, you brought them all?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.54,1:01:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ones that run fairly well. Not all of them, though...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.19,1:01:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, we'll get to see the legendary Cave Story Alpha in action?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.14,1:01:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you brought the Alpha version of Cave Story too today?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.60,1:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, I have it, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.20,1:01:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the tempo is off, so I'm thinking, what do I do...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-The one in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.10,1:01:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.51,1:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's embarrassing, I bet? Having to put it on display now, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.54,1:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.54,1:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Actually, it seems like there's a lot here...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.79,1:01:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.13,1:01:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.16,1:01:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.47,1:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, this,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.16,1:01:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,this is, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.29,1:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,something I just kinda tried making to "make something".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.76,1:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is the first thing you made, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.09,1:01:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.16,1:01:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no time to search, I guess, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.92,1:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nah, don't worry, we got time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.21,1:01:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-We dooo?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.06,1:01:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Part 2 of the event is a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.36,1:01:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, I'll take my time... There it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.19,1:01:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the screen's too small, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.88,1:01:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This first one...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.84,1:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,chicchai no nustekurete??? iu ta nda yo kedo
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.03,1:02:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, but he backed everything up in nemame???
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.62,1:02:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Unfortunately, I don't have the source...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.03,1:02:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, true, there's no source.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.08,1:02:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is Cave Story?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.34,1:02:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhm, yes, kinda.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.50,1:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is the initial version?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.40,1:02:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's gotten quiet, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.64,1:02:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.28,1:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So uh, this, Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.04,1:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,this Cave Story that I was making in the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.95,1:02:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, ultimately, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.06,1:02:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I was aiming at making a simple game,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.60,1:02:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're hungry, in an unknown place. How long can you survive?"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.63,1:02:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...that's the sort of game it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.52,1:02:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Totally different from now, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.81,1:02:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right... while I was making it... there were a lot of...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.28,1:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Rather severe setting, innit?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.64,1:02:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is the character doing in this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.48,1:02:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, the map is kind of formless right now, in the development stage,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.93,1:02:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.97,1:02:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-and I remade it after that, something that runs a little better...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.70,1:02:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... was it here? I hope this runs alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me get this ready - oh it already is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.60,1:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.05,1:03:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The screen is a bit small, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.23,1:03:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This was just about picking up fruits, which was kind of boring, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.82,1:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The protagonist here looks kind of like the protagonist from Cave Story, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.70,1:03:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, he's wearing a cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.90,1:03:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, the cap. Although it's blue here...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.05,1:03:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the sort of game this became.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.50,1:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And at this point, well, I gave it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.99,1:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-At this point?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the program was a huge sticky mess by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.62,1:03:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Any developers in the audience probably know this, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.15,1:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you head into development without a plan, it slowly but surely gets all messed up, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.30,1:03:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, what I made after this was Ikachan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.07,1:03:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And making Ikachan-
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.56,1:03:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see. So before Ikachan, you made these, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.88,1:03:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.80,1:03:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,these projects that never saw the light of day, as practice for Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.00,1:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-The things we just looked at.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.76,1:03:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-And after finishing Ikachan, I started this-
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.32,1:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[loud music]
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.00,1:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.11,1:03:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wow, that's loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.97,1:03:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Volume control here...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.05,1:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.85,1:04:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let me just reduce the volume, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.04,1:04:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-About 50% should be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.82,1:04:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.80,1:04:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this is kind of a pain...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.00,1:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ikachan was distributed, though. A lot of people know about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.90,1:04:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, I released it...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.64,1:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a lot of people who only know Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.11,1:04:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Anyone who's played Ikachan here? Raise your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.88,1:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-Woah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.59,1:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-They've all played it, nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.33,1:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.02,1:04:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's cool is, there's a grade-schooler over there,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.64,1:04:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you for playing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.30,1:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,who raised their hand as hard as they could, like they thought "Yes!" and wanted to show it. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.60,1:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Anyways, I remade this after that, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.20,1:04:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-This looks a bit more... game-ish, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.85,1:04:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, though there's still a little friction in there...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.20,1:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's BGM too, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.32,1:04:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the BGM here is something I developed, called Piyopiyo...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.84,1:04:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.71,1:04:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Organya wasn't a thing yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.44,1:04:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.86,1:04:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-I believe this was, like, developed with Ikachan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.26,1:04:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.78,1:04:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.80,1:04:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was at that stage here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.57,1:04:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-For the background music,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.01,1:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,system wa pisu??? no mono wo tsukatteru n desu kedo
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.40,1:05:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but well,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.91,1:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn't that good, so I redid it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.60,1:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After redoing that...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.69,1:05:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was from this point that Cave Story took 5 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.36,1:05:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, 5 years counting from there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.73,1:05:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What about what we just saw?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.82,1:05:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Alpha version doesn't count?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.32,1:05:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-That was one year. Then I made Ikachan and the thing we saw earlier...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.40,1:05:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huuhhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.05,1:05:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, he was hospitalised twice in that time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.10,1:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.82,1:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.05,1:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hospitalised twice, right...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.20,1:05:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ikachan was actually developed while he was in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.38,1:05:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.84,1:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-First he had... was it pneumonia?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Umm, they uh, they said it was tuberculosis...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.50,1:05:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, kekkaku wasaki??? ka
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.76,1:05:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-I was under quarantine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.98,1:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh my...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.89,1:05:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-No visitors, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.07,1:05:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.82,1:05:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is...\N-It's Cave Story!\N-You can recognise Cave Story now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.39,1:05:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least, the Cave Story that I then remade...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.36,1:05:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}DIM PATH
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.05,1:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-The Beta version, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.16,1:05:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, this is called the "Beta version"...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.24,1:05:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.96,1:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So here I had a money-based system,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.68,1:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so with this, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.68,1:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,By managing your money, you could buy weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.32,1:06:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.64,1:06:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.88,1:06:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ammo is limited, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.62,1:06:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.18,1:06:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-The thing on top?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.74,1:06:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.78,1:06:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-that reads 37?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.15,1:06:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, 37.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.00,1:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The upper-left is ammo, and the lower-left is money, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.47,1:06:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Correct. If you have 37 bullets, then, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.64,1:06:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,they disappear in no time. So you have to economise...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.89,1:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PUU'S RESTAURANT
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.99,1:06:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}OPENED THE TREASURE CHEST.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.93,1:06:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}GOT 100 CION.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.32,1:06:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the basic problem here...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.03,1:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}HEY THERE.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.79,1:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}WELCOME TO PUU'S RESTAURANT.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.59,1:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hey there." Should be here soon...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.06,1:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}WELL NOW, TODAY'S MENU IS...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.84,1:06:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah!\N-Huh?\N-This is, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.16,1:06:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh, looks different.\N-It's Balrog's predecessor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.06,1:06:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, that's...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.33,1:06:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-4? What's 4 mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.19,1:06:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? 4? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.64,1:06:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.55,1:06:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd added serial numbers to keep track of the face graphics.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.14,1:06:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}HUH, YOU'RE NOT A MIMIGA?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.57,1:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THEN, DO YOU WANNA BE BUBBLE FRIENDS WITH ME?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.24,1:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}AIN'T NO WAY THAT'S HAPPENING.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.82,1:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PUU KNOWS YOU.\NYOU CAME HERE TO KILL ME, DIDNT'CHA?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.82,1:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, he doesn't just look like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.00,1:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.47,1:06:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to erase it in the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.80,1:06:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's not version 4 or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.91,1:06:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, no, he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.22,1:06:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, Balrog-
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.68,1:06:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-mou daibu ???
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.36,1:06:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.80,1:06:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is Balrog, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.16,1:06:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's called "Puu", he came before Balrog.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:06:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.24,1:07:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woops, no ammo left.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.59,1:07:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.37,1:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, what do you do if you run out of ammo?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.69,1:07:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-If your ammo runs out...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.87,1:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I still had some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.26,1:07:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can beat-
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.84,1:07:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]\N-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.64,1:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}CONTINUE? YES/NO
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.01,1:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Aww...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.56,1:07:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what kind of game this was.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.84,1:07:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.62,1:07:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So this, I uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.70,1:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this took two years,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.97,1:07:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.60,1:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was almost finished,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.68,1:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.51,1:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I hadn't shown this to many people yet, only a few close friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.76,1:07:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and they had good things to say about it, pretty much,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.52,1:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,however, uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.38,1:07:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this person called Nao who had taught me programming,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.42,1:07:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Nao"-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.00,1:07:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.32,1:07:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.84,1:07:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And he had some really severe criticism for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.92,1:07:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.82,1:07:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After showing it to him, I lost all self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.43,1:07:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.40,1:07:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He-
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.71,1:07:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-He really criticised it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.38,1:07:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, boy, he criticised it, he lambasted it to no end.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.59,1:08:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I showed it to some other friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.06,1:08:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and they had mostly unfavourable reviews,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.64,1:08:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One day when he'd come over to hang out, I had him play the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.88,1:08:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Going further, there were all sorts of problems I kept trying to plug up,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.24,1:08:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.00,1:08:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the end I just redid the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.02,1:08:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-So what exactly were the problems?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.08,1:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.54,1:08:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.96,1:08:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, they said it was hard to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.12,1:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at the gameplay from earlier, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.33,1:08:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When the player was lost, you wouldn't know where to go, and end up wandering in circles...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.16,1:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,mo kyukutaa??? ni iu to sore no katamari nan desu ne
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.74,1:08:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this constant feeling of "I don't know what to do now".
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.44,1:08:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, in the old version, when you went through the door in the first cave,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.86,1:08:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you found yourself in the Plantation already.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.52,1:08:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, the Plantation used to be an initial stage.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.72,1:08:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.66,1:08:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.04,1:08:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was big, and you couldn't tell where to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.00,1:08:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now that you mention it, yes, it was big and easy to get lost in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.06,1:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Earlier, you died in that boss fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.64,1:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, so if that happens-
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.82,1:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-If you're out of ammo, how do you survive?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.50,1:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, if you're out, well, you just die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.94,1:09:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.33,1:09:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't any scope for rescue...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.76,1:09:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huuhhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.29,1:09:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Pretty harsh, eh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.81,1:09:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.35,1:09:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It is...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.76,1:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-So if you're forced into a situation like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.76,1:09:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, um, I wanted to do something about it, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.48,1:09:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Normally, if someone's developing a free game, then to that extent...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.08,1:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,like, to say, "Change it all from the ground up!"...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.52,1:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.14,1:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, since it's free, you also have to rely on others, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "it's free, so you don't need to work that hard..."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.42,1:09:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-It would be more normal to just give up, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.28,1:09:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "This ain't happening!"
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.38,1:09:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahaha.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.25,1:09:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.33,1:09:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, while I was working on something,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.84,1:09:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd just be thinking, man, I wanna start making the next game soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.80,1:09:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So then I'd start hurrying it up,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.03,1:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,hanashi nashuu ???
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.78,1:09:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you'd start dreaming about your next work.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.04,1:09:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, um, the weapon system and all, the game's problematic part,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.29,1:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it made me want to redo it,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.96,1:10:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.60,1:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd been troubled for awhile, like, "What do I do about this?"
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.13,1:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally concluded that there was no choice but to start again from the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.90,1:10:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-This remaking business is described on Wikipedia and such, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.48,1:10:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.47,1:10:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-And the restarted development took a year, basically?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.99,1:10:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, from there, it was a year of\Nremaking, and then a year of brush-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.08,1:10:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.59,1:10:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.46,1:10:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With something or another coming up, it took about 3 years before I could rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.88,1:10:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-So Nao-san, on whose advice you restarted development...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.14,1:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you show him your progress when working on the new version?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.02,1:10:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, about that...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.07,1:10:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't show him!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.99,1:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.83,1:10:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.08,1:10:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Because of the criticism the first time?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.34,1:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. I was scared, so I didn't show it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.08,1:10:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When the game was finished, at that time, um,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.01,1:10:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I really just wanted to go "Woohoo! All done!"
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.85,1:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But right after, I had to follow through more than I'd thought,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.97,1:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,chasing bugfix after bugfix...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.70,1:11:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was like, enough, I just want to get away from this game already!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.24,1:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really chipping away at my nerves...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was it listening to Nao-san's criticism
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.93,1:11:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that led to the brushing-up?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.20,1:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right. So, he was...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.04,1:11:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the key person, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.36,1:11:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.32,1:11:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nao-san is here in the audience, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.37,1:11:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.04,1:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wonder if he can share what sort of commentary he had...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.39,1:11:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The wireless mike, Nao-san has it right now, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.19,1:11:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-He has it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.21,1:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.\N-Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.00,1:11:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then, Nao-san, well... the camera isn't focused toward you,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.28,1:11:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but from the audience, please share a few words.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.68,1:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just the voice...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.20,1:11:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't try and look for him, ya hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.60,1:11:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]\N-Don't look for him, you say? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.84,1:11:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Nao-san, can you tell us about what sort of advice,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.41,1:11:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...err, criticism, you had to share at that time?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.28,1:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.83,1:11:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-If you would please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.80,1:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-The gist of it, like Amaya-kun mentioned earlier,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.80,1:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.04,1:11:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapon system, and not knowing where to go next,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.92,1:11:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,if these major- it wasn't stimulating, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.39,1:12:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if these problems were resolved, that'd be nice, is what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.35,1:12:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.55,1:12:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The game he made earlier, Ikachan, was compact,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.12,1:12:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.58,1:12:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.82,1:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was cohesive and well-arranged,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.93,1:12:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so when [Cave Story Beta] came out, it was a bit different from what I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was flimsy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.75,1:12:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.10,1:12:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Flimsy?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.20,1:12:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh... in Ikachan's time,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.28,1:12:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the era of gaming was brief ???, so that was fine, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.36,1:12:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,this time I was close to thinking, the scope of this game is really big, it'll be impossible to manage.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.14,1:12:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.28,1:12:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.27,1:12:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes... Also,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.68,1:12:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,while the action was fun, the same way as in today's Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.33,1:12:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,tama wo bari bari uttete kyotao??? sou to omottara, ano
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.01,1:12:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,okane de kawanai teki nai de mottainakute tama ga utenai???
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.70,1:12:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.26,1:12:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,doushite mo ano okane no system wo irenakute???
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,sutto iu kota o mise ga hoshii to. tte o mise ni hinpai ni kite morau ni wa, ???
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.59,1:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,buki no tamakazu wo seigen shinai to ikenakunatte
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.27,1:12:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.01,1:12:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And, when you run out of ammo, like in the boss fight earlier,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.90,1:13:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you may have money left, but you can't find a shop...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.40,1:13:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be an action game,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.31,1:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are spots like that where the tempo is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.30,1:13:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, also,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.17,1:13:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The free version didn't jou gei uchi???
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.99,1:13:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.01,1:13:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually wanted to be able to\Nshoot downward when in midair,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.86,1:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but shooting vertically wasn't\Nimplemented in old Cave Story.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.40,1:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, there was a puzzle-based stage,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.48,1:13:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PAZARU TEKI NA SUTEEJI
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.99,1:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.24,1:13:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,where you have to figure out how, what sequence,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.41,1:13:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to break blocks in to be able to proceed...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.19,1:13:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So that didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.48,1:13:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see, so it got to where you had to rework it entirely.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.00,1:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.63,1:13:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, but wait, with the adoption of the money system, off the bat,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.88,1:13:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.99,1:13:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it makes sense to feel strongly about it one way or the other. ???
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.72,1:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.53,1:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, you would be quite curious about what you can buy there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.14,1:13:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.96,1:13:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,maa iwareta toki wa soko made dekinee yo to wa iu ndesu kedo ???
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.57,1:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.37,1:13:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,??? demo jissai mada hitori de program wo shiteru to sono
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.07,1:13:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,sono scene wo tooru tabi??? iwareta koto omoidashite
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.43,1:13:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-During development?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.37,1:14:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, during development, like eugh... gotta redo this after all... But it did get better!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.50,1:14:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When I got rid of limitations on weapons and made them all unlimited ammo...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.24,1:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hella fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.54,1:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.28,1:14:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end - in the end -
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.55,1:14:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-masa niima??? no doukutsu monogatari no sugata desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.36,1:14:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right. Uhm...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.26,1:14:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought there would be a thrill when you run out of mon- I mean, ammo,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.61,1:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but instead of thrill, it was more like stress.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.03,1:14:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.05,1:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-iu koto ni higasuite???, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.23,1:14:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-In the final version, you have missiles that saabisu suru??? boss fights, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.12,1:14:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this in reaction to that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.11,1:14:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.93,1:14:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Aww, man... I guess I forgot and left that in!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.64,1:14:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was that a remnant of the old system?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.00,1:14:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.72,1:14:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm... I guess, yeah, when it came to the missiles... you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.47,1:14:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.70,1:14:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,kekkyoku sou desu ne ano nanka tii??? ga nanka baramaite
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.54,1:14:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,??? sore wo hirou no wa doushite mo iratakatte
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.29,1:14:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,sore ga energy capsule toka iu no de
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.56,1:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.28,1:14:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The 'Yellow Item' in today's menu, that's its name.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.40,1:14:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that the official name? 'Energy Capsule'?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.76,1:14:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, it's like, energy for your weapon, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.16,1:15:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's... Not an official name.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.15,1:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-So it's not an official name?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.98,1:15:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, it's not?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.55,1:15:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.32,1:15:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-They don't look like capsules though, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.06,1:15:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.12,1:15:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-They're triangle-shaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.68,1:15:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-They look like triangles.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.52,1:15:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-They're triangles.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.66,1:15:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.36,1:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh... 4-sided dice?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.23,1:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-4-sided dice, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.51,1:15:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Or what we call a "d4".
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.65,1:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.42,1:15:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-You guys get what I'm saying, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.89,1:15:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Not really...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.68,1:15:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh you do, thanks guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.31,1:15:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.16,1:15:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-TTRPG players in the audience, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.56,1:15:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Today... You're right,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.03,1:15:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look around, there's a lot of young people, which is kind of surprising.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.35,1:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cave Story was originally meant to be, nostalgic,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.33,1:15:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.41,1:15:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to people who'd played on the Famicom,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.41,1:15:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: Known outside of Japan as the NES.]
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.71,1:15:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.69,1:15:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,or old things like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.65,1:15:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But it coming out on WiiWare and such,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.76,1:15:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that's only been possible because there are so many younger players,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.08,1:15:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,so thank you for your support.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.00,1:15:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, the popularity on Niconico Douga,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.01,1:15:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's what caused the word to spread.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.00,1:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I see...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.32,1:15:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-When I tried playing it,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.00,1:15:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.35,1:15:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was... easy to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.08,1:16:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.\N-Yeah.\N-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.66,1:16:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-The jumping movement feels good,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.71,1:16:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no lag when attacking.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.47,1:16:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.57,1:16:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The difficult mechanics you mentioned earlier were excised,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.72,1:16:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.43,1:16:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving behind a simple, easy-to-play system.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.51,1:16:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And you get to enjoy these elements right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.31,1:16:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There were many such parts in the game, I feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.18,1:16:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-No matter what, when developing, you feel like, "I wanna do this and I wanna do that too,"
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.44,1:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're so right. Like,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.34,1:16:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Also, a big obstacle is when you think,\N"I wanna make a game that's totally novel."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.44,1:16:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.26,1:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With Cave Story, there weren't any particularly new mechanics,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.68,1:16:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a lot like games that are already around.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.92,1:16:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I just tried making a game like that in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.45,1:16:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,dakara tsukutteru toki, kansei ssu no kondake ga attandesuyo yappari ano
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.69,1:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,tsukutteru aida ni, nitai you na game wo dareka ga dasun janai ka tte iu no wa,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.79,1:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,kekkou bikurishite tsukuttetan desu yo ???
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.65,1:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-But anyways, you had really been rushing, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.40,1:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like, "I wanna release this quick."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.46,1:16:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-I was in a hurry, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.24,1:16:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of times I considered releasing an incomplete version, thinking, "I really wanna show this off!"
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.94,1:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,With the way I only did one final release,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.48,1:17:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It really sapped my motivation during development,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.03,1:17:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,because I really wanted to show it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.01,1:17:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.03,1:17:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,sore mo kekkou tsurae ??? toki
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.16,1:17:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.46,1:17:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It took like, 5 or 6 years for development, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.60,1:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Being able to say, "I did it!",
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.80,1:17:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the finish line just out of reach,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.36,1:17:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,sitting at your computer the whole time, clacking away at the keyboard,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.36,1:17:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.00,1:17:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking, what am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.12,1:17:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.71,1:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah so uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.24,1:17:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The brush-up was actually pretty fun,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.56,1:17:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until then I'd been alone, working in silence...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.41,1:17:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, during [brush-up], there were various prob-
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.41,1:17:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Err...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.53,1:17:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of requests I heard out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.38,1:17:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-And you passed?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.26,1:17:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-I passed, yeah, a lot of feedback went back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.00,1:17:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, Cave Story wouldn't be what it is, if not for this process, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.90,1:17:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.43,1:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, the weapon level system was brought up earlier...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.85,1:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.12,1:17:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This wasn't in the previous version, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.94,1:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, it wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.37,1:17:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was implementing this also a part of Nao-san's advice?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.90,1:17:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-That was, well... uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.12,1:17:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea of picking something up to improve your weapons,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.12,1:17:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.65,1:17:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rid of money, so in its place...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.62,1:18:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-You wanted something else to pick up?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.28,1:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, I wanted something for players to pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.91,1:18:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This would motivate them to actually kill enemies, so yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.96,1:18:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it was. I think it worked out almost miraculously well...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.61,1:18:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.94,1:18:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.68,1:18:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-jaa nerattetatte yori wa tsukutte mita kekka yokatta tte iu kanji nandesu ne
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.88,1:18:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right. Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.88,1:18:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On the whole, in the game,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.10,1:18:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to think while moving,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.02,1:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you don't have a strategy, you can't implement the tactics.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.05,1:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.09,1:18:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's no worldbuilding either.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.39,1:18:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.57,1:18:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-nanka itsumo ichimai e mitai nano kaite, de soko kara
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.28,1:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,kore wo doushitara game ni naru ka tte ??? douyatte koto ga ooin desu yo
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.56,1:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, right...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.40,1:18:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.02,1:18:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, back in the day, I would get magazines of the Famicom and such,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.00,1:18:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and they would include lots of screenshots of games.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.03,1:18:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.84,1:18:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.40,1:18:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And restricted to looking at the screenshots, I thought it was super cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.41,1:18:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought, man, I really wanna try this! And when I did,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.81,1:18:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it wasn't like what I'd thought. You know, like with film trailers.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.83,1:18:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.24,1:18:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, when looking at those screenshots,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.08,1:18:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the impressions I had - if I could give them shape, I could make something interesting, I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.91,1:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, even if it's relatively small, "I want a game like this", or "it would be nice to have a game like this"...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.00,1:19:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-maa arui wa deshou ne ano\N-tama tte tte katachi ???
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.27,1:19:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.27,1:19:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-senzaiteki ni doushite mo
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.98,1:19:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Seeing that version of Cave Story earlier made me think...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.03,1:19:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That airy quality of the jumping movement hasn't changed, has it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.37,1:19:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you're right. About that,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.38,1:19:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-About that,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.80,1:19:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,did you feel like the jumping was already perfected by that point?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.96,1:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right, I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.16,1:19:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this might be a bit of a technical discussion, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.68,1:19:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.87,1:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, how much gravity do I set to make the player move like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.35,1:19:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,While moving, too, there's minor adjustments going on, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.67,1:19:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to climb this part, but I can't -\Nhow do I achieve that height?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.11,1:19:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I had made these decisions in the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.28,1:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so it just remained like that the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.98,1:19:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.42,1:19:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-The jump feels quite airy, were you particular about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.84,1:19:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, I was wondering how much should you be able to
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.01,1:19:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,adjust your trajectory mid-air, and various stuff like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.37,1:19:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But stuff I've played so far, they're rather,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.71,1:19:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,influenced by the vibe and tone of other games, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.66,1:20:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-So in the beginning, the jump you implemented,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.33,1:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it was basically through trial-and-error, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.04,1:20:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-But you know, he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.60,1:20:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He was fussing over the details,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.92,1:20:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and ended up happy with how it turned out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.12,1:20:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once while we were talking, he brought up
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.40,1:20:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the topic of the jump in Super Mario,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.50,1:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.72,1:20:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and your trajectory when you collide with a pipe-
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.89,1:20:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah yes, that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.39,1:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He really liked that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.27,1:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.37,1:20:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-donna koto itenasu??? ka
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.24,1:20:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, from the start, I thought Super Mario had really good movement...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.12,1:20:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.64,1:20:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I suppose no one actually jumps like that, though...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.20,1:20:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.82,1:20:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, sorry, let's hear the details. What exactly...?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.54,1:20:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, the pipes look... like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.39,1:20:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So... When you jump towards the pipe,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.33,1:20:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-When you jump...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.62,1:20:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and just as you start to ascend, you collide with it,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.64,1:20:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,sono toki ni, dou iu tsugi kyourou??? suru ka
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.27,1:20:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah,\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.73,1:20:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we draw it out...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.00,1:20:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, on the board? Ah, yes, please go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.22,1:20:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.50,1:20:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gee, this might've become a bit of a bother...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.69,1:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.80,1:21:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure if I can make my point in this space,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.07,1:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but let's say this is our pipe,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.70,1:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and when we jump,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.24,1:21:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,well, if you can't alter your trajectory mid-jump,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.42,1:21:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...this is what it ends up like, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.48,1:21:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm, yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.57,1:21:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So after this, no matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.42,1:21:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,when you hit a pipe you know your trajectory will go like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.60,1:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.10,1:21:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and you want to be able to, uh, right yourself...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.89,1:21:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"It would be helpful to control my movement midair!"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.98,1:21:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-After that, ??? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.94,1:21:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.86,1:21:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you consider the laws of physics, moving like that in midair...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.19,1:21:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Isn't possible, yes. Generally,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.19,1:21:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Isn't possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.74,1:21:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,when thinking of making a game,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.51,1:21:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you wish you have flashes of insight like this...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.39,1:21:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-nanka sou iu tokoro o
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.96,1:21:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,jibun de ???. He's been like that since his student days.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.12,1:21:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.93,1:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been making games since he was a student, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.27,1:21:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.37,1:21:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, uh, I learnt programming from Nao, who I mentioned earlier,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.24,1:21:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and, with that as my impetus, started making games-
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.92,1:21:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.61,1:21:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How old were you at this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.10,1:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-I was a teenager, I think uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.46,1:21:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-19, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.18,1:22:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-[inaudible]???
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.66,1:22:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh? Rather late, innit?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.47,1:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-It is late, yeah. I didn't have a PC at home either...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.20,1:22:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.64,1:22:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, Cave Story's initial, uh, Alpha version,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.41,1:22:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,that was like, the 2nd or 3rd thing he made on his own from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.84,1:22:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.42,1:22:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So bit by bit, as he figured out what he could program,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.11,1:22:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,he got around to games?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.31,1:22:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.45,1:22:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, at that time, I was like, I would love to be able to make a game like this...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.15,1:22:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I really like action games after all, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.54,1:22:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, action games...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.18,1:22:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Apart from that I've made shooting games and stuff too, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.25,1:22:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of busy, so with what little time I have,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.16,1:22:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like, hmm, how much of this game can I make?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.61,1:22:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I don't like shooters as much.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.16,1:22:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.71,1:22:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've made shooters too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.50,1:22:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, I have... It's called Guxt,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.87,1:22:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's a game made on really low resolution, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.29,1:22:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, did you bring that too, today?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.66,1:22:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this... oh, a rebuild...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.84,1:22:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Looks like I moved it...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.64,1:22:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Guxt, though, it's a pretty long game you made, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.53,1:22:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah well, I started making a small shooting game,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.84,1:22:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and it took...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.71,1:23:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a year, yeah, one year.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.46,1:23:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-At first,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.61,1:23:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a fullscreen version thing too, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.41,1:23:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh... That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.64,1:23:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A much older thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.65,1:23:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, some of the face graphics from that... have remained-
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.25,1:23:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-The eyeball characters.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.20,1:23:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, all the characters in Guxt are eyeball-based...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.37,1:23:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, where was this...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.00,1:23:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting game, right... STG...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.96,1:23:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I brought it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.98,1:23:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Shall we move on then?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.83,1:23:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.80,1:23:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-So to start with, was there any particular event,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.87,1:23:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that made you think, "I want to start making games"?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.15,1:23:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, I've always really wanted to make games, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.75,1:23:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.42,1:23:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea how to make them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.29,1:23:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know the word "programming".
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.32,1:23:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, when I was in my senior year of high school, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.66,1:23:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.48,1:23:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really into game music,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.96,1:23:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.81,1:23:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd record music on a keyboard,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.81,1:23:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: {\i1}'uchikomi'{\i0} means either 'step recording (in electronic music)', or 'putting one's heart into'. Both meanings fit here; was it a pun?]
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.24,1:24:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,imagining that I'm making music for my own game,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.07,1:24:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,PCM wo tsukuttare ???
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.27,1:24:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-So you started with the music, and imagined the game from there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.52,1:24:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. With Cave Story, too, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.38,1:24:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,in the case of Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it was the music that was developed first.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.90,1:24:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.75,1:24:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-The music first?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.56,1:24:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes... I conceived the rest of the game following the soundtrack.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.46,1:24:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, the song we heard earlier, Cave Story followed from that, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.44,1:24:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, right, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.96,1:24:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, um,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.86,1:24:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that thing from before Ikachan,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.29,1:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,its title screen music was called 'Cave Story',
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.14,1:24:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,not this, I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.84,1:24:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was it this?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.54,1:24:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhmm... That's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.54,1:24:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-All these are sound production programs, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.54,1:24:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.30,1:24:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-Mus-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.47,1:24:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Err, yes, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.03,1:24:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first thought about making a game soundtrack,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.02,1:24:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,generally, on the PC, you had MIDI.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.72,1:24:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.46,1:24:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I uh, had originally recorded sampled audio with PCM,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to distribute the finished game to people, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.52,1:24:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I ran into a problem of volume-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.44,1:25:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,WAV files were much too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.07,1:25:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,MP3 wasn't a thing yet, at least, it wasn't common.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.59,1:25:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.91,1:25:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd do my soundtrack in MIDI,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.22,1:25:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but back then there were a lot of people who didn't have MIDI,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.44,1:25:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.84,1:25:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-I get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.57,1:25:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-So - You get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.71,1:25:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That was around 2000...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.89,1:25:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's lots of soundfonts you can have in MIDI,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.92,1:25:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that all sound different, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.02,1:25:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, you can have a virtual sound source, but that's...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.65,1:25:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really heavy, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.89,1:25:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't do for a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.89,1:25:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,ano koukau??? no narashi kata wa wakatta to
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.31,1:25:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sore de doremiya sorashido wo koukan wo dzushite irete???
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.32,1:25:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.77,1:25:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"kiyoku tsukureba ii jan" tte iu tokoro ga hajimattan desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.64,1:25:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.80,1:25:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-motomoto koukau??? no system ni, onkai wo noseta mitai na kanji?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.72,1:25:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.53,1:25:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.48,1:25:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I started with at first,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.82,1:25:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and um...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.70,1:25:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I started from there,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.52,1:25:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and once I learnt a bit about waveforms,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.66,1:25:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,hakei-teki kiyoku speaker ga dou zengu suru ka dake
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.18,1:25:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,tte iu koto ni kigatsuitara,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.28,1:26:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,sugoi omoshiroku natte,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.67,1:26:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.20,1:26:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so I made a software where you can fiddle with the waveforms.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.20,1:26:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-You started with something fiddly?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.92,1:26:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.48,1:26:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.31,1:26:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-So before I restarted Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.04,1:26:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,when I wanted to make the next thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.69,1:26:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,that is, Organya's successor, namely Pxtone Collage,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.99,1:26:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.08,1:26:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...I didn't bring it today, but it...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.46,1:26:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a handful.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.55,1:26:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.06,1:26:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,program wa nan nin ka to tsukiae arun desukedo
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.41,1:26:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.92,1:26:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This sound program, if it just runs within the game, that's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.78,1:26:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So by holding back on its construction, you can make it quickly,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.77,1:26:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.27,1:26:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just include only the necessary parts for playback,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.87,1:26:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and you can get away with, well, a simple program.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.64,1:26:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Why bother with all the frilly graphics...?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.15,1:26:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.20,1:26:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-All the cute animals and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.60,1:26:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.76,1:26:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right. So uh, the thing up here, called PiyoPiyo,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.20,1:26:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew all these superfluous fishes and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.43,1:26:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one is PiyoPiyo, right?\N-Like these here...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.56,1:26:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one? I see.\N-Yeah, this is PiyoPiyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.73,1:26:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So for the Ikachan soundtrack, I made- er, I used this engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.60,1:26:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-So about when did you start to draw?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.75,1:26:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, drawing, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.46,1:27:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been drawing since long ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.57,1:27:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never really studied or learnt to do it properly...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.33,1:27:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.28,1:27:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The programming came last?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.91,1:27:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.68,1:27:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh...\N-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.67,1:27:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.16,1:27:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bit unusual, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.88,1:27:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Pretty unusual I think, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.96,1:27:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Were you also self-taught in music?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.95,1:27:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-You know, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.93,1:27:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-As for music, well, I had an Electone, which I took a few lessons for.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.60,1:27:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Electone is that thing by Yamaha...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.60,1:27:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: Electones are a line of electronic organs produced by Yamaha.]
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.89,1:27:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.76,1:27:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With an Electone, your left hand constantly presses down on ???,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.08,1:27:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and the harmony is played automatically...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.28,1:27:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.00,1:27:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So from there I picked up on how that's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.38,1:27:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see...\N-Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.93,1:27:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, adding melodies on top,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.48,1:27:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried it out, just kind of starting somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.82,1:27:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.60,1:27:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um, just to add onto that a bit, but uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.71,1:27:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In those days, kono "CS" tte iu mono desu to ka
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.38,1:27:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,sono mae ni deteta game wo korotte??? no wa
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.35,1:27:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,they weren't released on the internet like they are now,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.42,1:27:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.49,1:27:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You had these things called floppy discs. Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.11,1:27:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.32,1:27:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, are there people who've heard of floppy disks here in the audience...?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.20,1:27:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Looks like it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.56,1:28:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-But we don't have floppies any more, right?\N-But floppy disks aren't really around any longer, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.68,1:28:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-naishi datte ne
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.20,1:28:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think 3.5" ???
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.08,1:28:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.73,1:28:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-But the 8", man, used it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.96,1:28:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I know the 8".
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.94,1:28:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, someone understands. I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.52,1:28:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-But yeah, despite compression, it couldn't fit under 1.44 MB.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.56,1:28:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, ruling out WAV and MIDI,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.44,1:28:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he thought, "Okay, I'll make my own thing to solve this problem!",
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.03,1:28:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus, PiyoPiyo was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.46,1:28:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-...so I made PiyoPiyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.90,1:28:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep. So Cave Story as it is now,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.14,1:28:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the file size is very, very tiny - as I'm sure you've all noticed,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.47,1:28:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,are mada zutto floppy wa, kare ga hikitsutterun desu yo???
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.74,1:28:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Downloading it from the internet, though,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.74,1:28:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-File size on a floppy...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.12,1:28:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,this was an era where any number of megabytes seemed like too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.32,1:28:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.32,1:28:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-sonna hayai kaisen ???
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.43,1:28:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.58,1:28:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to download 1 MB would make you go insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.81,1:28:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of era it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.08,1:28:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-By the way, how heavy is the final version of Cave Story?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.32,1:28:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, I'm not sure what it is after decompression,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.96,1:28:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but the compressed file is 1 MB...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.64,1:28:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's really tiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.72,1:29:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.30,1:29:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.37,1:29:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-But yeah, to get a smaller filesize,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.13,1:29:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the assembler to optimise and really squeeze it like an obsessed weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.07,1:29:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.70,1:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Managed to shave off several hundred kB that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.99,1:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.24,1:29:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's as far as I got, though...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.08,1:29:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, but the small filesize is also good for the DSiWare release and such, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.51,1:29:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.18,1:29:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.51,1:29:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the problem of the console specifications,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.46,1:29:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but definitely, if it was made to run well on PC,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.34,1:29:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then porting it to DSi won't pose any problems, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.48,1:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now this might be a slightly delicate matter, but Naramura-san's La-Mulana,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.52,1:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.84,1:29:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.08,1:29:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,when porting it to WiiWare, filesize was a big concern, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.79,1:29:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-shiruka to omoimashita yo ne???
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.53,1:29:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-That blog post was quite something.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.90,1:29:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-So in our case, at first,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.09,1:29:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,we didn't really...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.99,1:29:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...think about the restrictions too much, and just kept developing freely.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.49,1:29:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When the constraints hit, we found we couldn't fit the graphics, the sound...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.93,1:29:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, one by one, we had to shave things off,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.22,1:29:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to fit things into a 32-bit machine,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.27,1:29:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,going back to how development was in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.73,1:29:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.64,1:30:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? chotto dassen shimasu kedo
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.42,1:30:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are there... many people here, who know La-Mulana...?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.02,1:30:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.\N-Looks like quite a few!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.39,1:30:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-'Preciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.17,1:30:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.37,1:30:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.09,1:30:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.97,1:30:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-[belly laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.96,1:30:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, that was Sameer-san, from a certain program. (???)
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.56,1:30:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here, but he's hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.84,1:30:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.12,1:30:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, so... Organya, we were able to implement that on the DSi fairly straightfowardly,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.36,1:30:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.80,1:30:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Considering the DSi port,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.50,1:30:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,well, it was quite close to Cave Story's PC version.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.16,1:30:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.85,1:30:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh, actually using tools like these...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.27,1:30:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,making the music in this,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.24,1:30:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.57,1:30:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,how does it work actually, like,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.56,1:30:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,could we have a look at the data?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.97,1:30:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Data? Right, hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.26,1:30:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok... Let's get the screen over here...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.61,1:30:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.20,1:30:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,kande karen da na???
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.74,1:30:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-So I'm pretty sure that the Organya files
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.04,1:30:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,from Cave Story have been made public, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.72,1:30:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, they have.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.92,1:31:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhm...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.39,1:31:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.28,1:31:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.86,1:31:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was it...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.05,1:31:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cave Story's...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.08,1:31:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be ORG, is this it...?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.76,1:31:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, lots of .org files here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.64,1:31:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.79,1:31:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the Organya you made for Cave Story?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.35,1:31:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, this is Organya.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.86,1:31:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-So this is actually, what we see here on-screen is what you used to make the soundtrack.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.46,1:31:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.65,1:31:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to get it in fullscreen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.02,1:31:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fine art, I just kinda brute-forced notes that sound good...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.90,1:31:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.37,1:31:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-How do you edit the data in this?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.79,1:31:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, new file...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.72,1:31:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, I'd like to see that, yeah.\N-Let's go...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.05,1:31:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here goes...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.08,1:31:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh? Click?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.48,1:31:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, you click.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.76,1:31:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you click again, the note is extended.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.55,1:31:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.13,1:31:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, it gets longer depending on how many times it was clicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.87,1:31:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.17,1:31:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hang on a sec. This is how you made all the songs in Cave Story?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.99,1:31:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Correct. Placing one note at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.57,1:32:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.24,1:32:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right, he didn't use a MIDI interface.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.80,1:32:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Though it could be said that's the natural way to do it...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.72,1:32:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.05,1:32:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-No keyboard input, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.62,1:32:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.47,1:32:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.60,1:32:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Doing this is fine-
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.28,1:32:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, this is how you did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.71,1:32:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, but well, when you look at it, it's like, Of course you can do it this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.60,1:32:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Like an "Oh, I see", kinda feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.30,1:32:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooohh, it's real!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.82,1:32:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just playing it by ear, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.53,1:32:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, but once you get used to it, it seems easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.66,1:32:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... Ah, but after making Organya,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.52,1:32:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I made something called Pxtone Collage,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.38,1:32:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.89,1:32:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and what was my motivation for that? Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.92,1:32:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,there were a lot of people using Organya,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.71,1:32:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and making music with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.76,1:32:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, people using Organya?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.60,1:32:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, it's a tool I released publicly...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.52,1:32:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So there were a lot of people using it...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.56,1:32:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So I felt like my homepage wasn't getting enough activity...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.95,1:32:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.64,1:32:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.08,1:32:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.46,1:33:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I made [Pxtone], yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.50,1:33:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-There are actually quite a few songs made in Organya that you can see uploaded on NND, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.20,1:33:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, and Pxtone Collage too.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.60,1:33:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.33,1:33:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... That's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.64,1:33:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh... What exactly is Pxtone Collage?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.76,1:33:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-You wanna take a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.09,1:33:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wanna see it.\N-Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.22,1:33:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.24,1:33:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where- which should I search...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.27,1:33:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.72,1:33:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.76,1:33:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Could you explain the differences between each of these composing softwares?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.95,1:33:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-So in PiyoPiyo,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.64,1:33:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,oto narasu tte iu shinmo??? shikanakatta ndesu yo
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.68,1:33:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.36,1:33:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.49,1:33:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is a bit-
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.20,1:33:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Maybe later, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.52,1:33:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-It is a bit much if you're not used to it...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.10,1:33:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.54,1:33:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a moment, ok then...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.10,1:33:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...And play...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.77,1:33:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.55,1:33:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the audio is, uh... the audio's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.84,1:33:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was just working with Organya, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.12,1:33:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.29,1:34:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.08,1:34:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this was made by a certain JAP-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.58,1:34:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.43,1:34:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,who regularly composes music, using Pxtone Collage.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.28,1:34:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So, at first, with PiyoPiyo, used in Ikachan,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.72,1:34:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,notes would play without stopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.03,1:34:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then in Organya, you could start a note and then stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.00,1:34:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, with Pxtone Collage,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.50,1:34:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you can record your own samples, and use them to make anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.83,1:34:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woahh.\N-Coool.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.90,1:34:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-You can stack waveforms?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.07,1:34:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.68,1:34:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Can you also import WAV files?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.50,1:34:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. About that,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.78,1:34:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, there are a lot of people who are
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.08,1:34:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,composing full-fledged, professional songs using their own samples.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.72,1:34:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.33,1:34:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The last on this list,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.28,1:34:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a link to a talk page that I want to see again,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.07,1:34:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,there's some amazing songs.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.54,1:34:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.15,1:34:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-By the way, I think this is that person who made an album, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.90,1:34:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooh...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.49,1:34:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.92,1:34:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, a foreigner again...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.92,1:34:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, until today I'd been asking them to send something, I'm glad I got approval.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.23,1:34:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,korenchuu de ???
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.19,1:34:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, we're doing the same thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.98,1:35:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,even now, when producing using a game device, we prepare the waveforms ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.16,1:34:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.34,1:35:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,de onkai wo, file tsukutte
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.31,1:35:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.32,1:35:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,kara sore kinenbi ni??? kanatteru to omoimasu yo
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.04,1:35:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, true.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.78,1:35:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.64,1:35:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, changing the frequency to make different notes, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.36,1:35:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.14,1:35:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm, If you use a chip's sound source,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.62,1:35:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it completes the work, and it sounds nice too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.40,1:35:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-True. Someone who likes this sort of sound is...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.37,1:35:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-I like it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.36,1:35:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.44,1:35:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-On the other hand, while I've tinkered with MIDI sound sources,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.07,1:35:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,something like a piano or guitar...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.44,1:35:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.02,1:35:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,samples that you'd have a word for,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.36,1:35:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good with instruments, so I don't have a sense for analysing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.79,1:35:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.65,1:35:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When I set out to make something like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.83,1:35:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,um,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.36,1:35:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sou iu oto dake de tsukureru ??? nante kara kyouzuki tanoshikunattanda
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.52,1:35:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.32,1:35:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-So I have a quick question,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.21,1:35:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sound,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.21,1:35:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.55,1:35:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you did that, then started drawing as a hobby,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.66,1:35:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and then started programming at 19?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.64,1:35:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.74,1:35:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that point, had you never felt like wanting to make a game?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.72,1:35:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.26,1:35:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, generally...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.13,1:35:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Before RPG Maker was a thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.24,1:35:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.01,1:35:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,there was something called Dante.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.21,1:35:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.48,1:35:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.80,1:35:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, in the countryside back then,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.63,1:36:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,no one had a PC, except this one friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.61,1:36:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.26,1:36:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was like, let's make an RPG!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.11,1:36:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so he said, and taught me...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.40,1:36:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to hang out at his place,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-In this dude's house?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.40,1:36:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.85,1:36:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.84,1:36:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, the game never got done in the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.37,1:36:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a bit of dialogue,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.81,1:36:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just got it running and started?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.21,1:36:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-and that was it - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.62,1:36:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We started with graphics, right? Pixel art,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.87,1:36:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.96,1:36:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd keep using really saturated reds and yellows,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.84,1:36:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.42,1:36:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and ended up making nothing but rather unrealistic characters.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.73,1:36:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But speaking of the history of pixel art,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.21,1:36:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.84,1:36:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't just up and buy a Famicom,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.74,1:36:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep it at home, but you still like games,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.21,1:36:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.52,1:36:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.38,1:36:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'd get yourself some graph paper,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.75,1:36:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and fill colours in that...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.95,1:36:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... and look through the magazines...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.95,1:36:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh my gosh, yes, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.58,1:36:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-You haven't done that?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.80,1:36:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.20,1:36:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, so you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.33,1:36:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.12,1:36:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I actually said I want a Famicom,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.05,1:36:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,my parents got me something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.54,1:36:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-And what was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.63,1:36:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was the MSX.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.20,1:36:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-Oh, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.39,1:36:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And my pocket money was never enough, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.12,1:36:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.77,1:37:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,game katte morae no wa meni ikkai katte???
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.25,1:37:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,demo sore wa mou, baka na you ni nari komushi ???
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.62,1:37:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, because we weren't allowed to buy it, ironically,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.15,1:37:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,we rebelled by becoming like this, getting deep into gaming...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.75,1:37:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.64,1:37:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.14,1:37:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-We survived a drought!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.12,1:37:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Even if we didn't have a Famicom,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.73,1:37:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,we wielded the effect of a Famicom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.82,1:37:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.44,1:37:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.81,1:37:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck through this door, open the map, pew-pew!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.52,1:37:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.44,1:37:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Playing the music in your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.58,1:37:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.38,1:37:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-An Air Famicom, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.40,1:37:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.\N-An Air Famicom, hah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.91,1:37:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.37,1:37:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, when's the last time you actually used a Famicom?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.16,1:37:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I finally bought one recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.40,1:37:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Recently?!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.39,1:37:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-You did not need to do that, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.63,1:37:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-I couldn't find a Famicom,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.04,1:37:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so, uh, I got a New Famicom.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.01,1:37:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.45,1:37:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.59,1:37:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-So you really never played it in its time?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.73,1:37:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-I didn't, no...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.61,1:37:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.48,1:37:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Cave Story has a bit of a Famicom feel to it...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.41,1:37:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that wasn't based on the real thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.76,1:37:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.13,1:37:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-So... When I was making it,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.80,1:37:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would never get done unless done in that style.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.55,1:37:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, but when I set out to work on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.86,1:37:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I found myself saying, this isn't good enough, that won't do...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.34,1:37:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when you're writing on a blackboard and you slowly end up drifting towards the upper-right...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.07,1:38:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's a funny example.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.18,1:38:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-demo akogare wo attan janai no kana?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.44,1:38:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hako nitai suru akogareta no wa, definitely
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.05,1:38:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,even now, kinda, a little bit remains, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.24,1:38:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-akogare wa...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.36,1:38:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.04,1:38:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.81,1:38:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Development borne out of Air Famicom hardship?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.78,1:38:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.23,1:38:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-The image of a Famicom you had in your head,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.24,1:38:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-konna machine ichiban dai???
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.28,1:38:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.78,1:38:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-is what came out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.55,1:38:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-was given form, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.88,1:38:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-This thing's specs are a bit more than the Famicom's, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.87,1:38:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.30,1:38:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.60,1:38:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, they're a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.20,1:38:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like specs for the ideal Famicom?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.36,1:38:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'd probably know if I programmed for the Super Famicom,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.82,1:38:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.67,1:38:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.26,1:38:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The memory just isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.51,1:38:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.39,1:38:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah yeah, there's a lot of kyarasuu??? and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.63,1:38:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.92,1:38:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-A lot of big maps need to be loaded, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.88,1:38:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, in the Famicom era,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.39,1:38:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,enemies that didn't appear on-screen didn't move,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.63,1:38:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.04,1:38:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you could effectively pretend they didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.52,1:38:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.66,1:38:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But in Cave Story, no matter how big the map is,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.98,1:38:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,everything is always walking around...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.88,1:38:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.94,1:38:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Famicom de mo tabun muzukashii geitoyatobun??? des yo ne...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.35,1:38:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.05,1:38:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.54,1:38:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see... But when I was younger,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.57,1:39:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I was just childishly sitting on the Famicom playing all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.49,1:38:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well-
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.60,1:39:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, y'know...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.16,1:39:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd visit friends and borrow software I wanted to try,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.63,1:39:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.30,1:39:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and then bring it to someone else's house and play it...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.82,1:39:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.67,1:39:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh man, oh man, oh man. That sure was an era.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.34,1:39:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.37,1:39:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-My parents really didn't like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.39,1:39:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.34,1:39:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm a parent, it's something I don't like either.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.76,1:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.44,1:39:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I'll do if my own child turns out like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.97,1:39:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.69,1:39:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.22,1:39:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh, so those feelings you had of wanting to do it,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.84,1:39:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you realised that, in a sense,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.92,1:39:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,through creating this work of self-expression.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.96,1:39:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.75,1:39:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-I guess you're right...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.65,1:39:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.24,1:39:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, moving along,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.88,1:39:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.24,1:39:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.46,1:39:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prior to this event, I saw a lot of Cave Story fan works,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.34,1:39:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,for example, on Pixiv, and Niconico Douga,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.28,1:39:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The fans have really made lots of great illustrations,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.88,1:39:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,or music using Organya,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.88,1:39:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, there is... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.22,1:39:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like derivative work is pretty popular,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.56,1:39:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.20,1:39:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaya-san, how do you see these fan works?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.80,1:39:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.25,1:40:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When the game finished development,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.44,1:40:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't wanna look at my-
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.02,1:40:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't even want to look at Cave Story at all anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.09,1:40:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Which, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.09,1:40:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.92,1:40:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't even know how many times I test-played it, trying to iron out bugs...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.92,1:40:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.62,1:40:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.14,1:40:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.94,1:40:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fixing bugs was not fun at all, haha...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.74,1:40:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, the rewarding moment came when...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.05,1:40:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,people posted on my BBS saying they liked it, or cleared it...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.80,1:40:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As for fan works, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.64,1:40:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen them, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.63,1:40:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like, "Ah, so this is how other people see it".
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.03,1:40:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,ano shinsensan??? ga atte...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.31,1:40:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.28,1:40:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's really well done. I'm no illustrator,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.08,1:40:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's so many people drawing Cave Story way better than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.28,1:40:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah... It makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.75,1:40:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really, fans of Cave Story have popped up everywhere, and are spreading far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.37,1:40:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.08,1:40:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.72,1:40:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh and yeah, the characters, they're super popular,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.02,1:40:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,could you tell us a bit about how you made them?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.02,1:40:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.95,1:40:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well uh, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.32,1:41:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, in the beginning, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.88,1:41:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't thought of anything in particular. I just added characters,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.82,1:41:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,one by one as necessary, and they turned out the way they are now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.15,1:41:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-meccha kekkou game no atama kara junban ni kansei saseteku shuhou desu ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.06,1:41:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-sore ga ne, atama no bubun dake chigaun desu yo
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.83,1:41:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.\N-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.84,1:41:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhm...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.00,1:41:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,At the moment, um,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.73,1:41:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I forget what exactly I'd finished with,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.39,1:41:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but in terms of the program, the source, the characters I made,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.21,1:41:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering all that,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.19,1:41:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the first thing I made was the Egg Corridor.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.76,1:41:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.34,1:41:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, so that was the first thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.32,1:41:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, after I restarted development.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.04,1:41:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.67,1:41:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-I've been wondering about this for a long time now, but in Cav-
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.66,1:41:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.84,1:41:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Egg Corridor, there's those elephants, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.47,1:41:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-There are.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.88,1:41:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.20,1:41:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They kinda, well, they seem pretty different from other enemy characters...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.46,1:41:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.95,1:41:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still developing with that Ikachan feeling...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.43,1:41:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Feeling"?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.18,1:41:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.76,1:41:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the characters in Ikachan are kind of simple...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.28,1:41:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just drew lines for the eyes, no frills here...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.41,1:41:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Teapot-looking elephant.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.53,1:41:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right... So...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.31,1:41:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I started development from there,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.04,1:42:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,sono hanashi no tsuzitsu mawaseru uchi ni
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.17,1:42:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.91,1:42:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,mae ga fuete andake ni nattete ??? desu ne
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.49,1:42:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? zenbu tsuku dakedo
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.17,1:42:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,koko ni narithka tarinai kara mata ta???
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.03,1:42:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.75,1:42:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.53,1:42:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you think of Cave Story,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.33,1:42:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the first scene that comes to mind, I'm sure,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.09,1:42:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,is of when you're outside, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.64,1:42:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes. Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.24,1:42:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,game wo tsukuru no ni doushite mo story mae ni deru to
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.84,1:42:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,tou scene janai kana tte iu no ga atte
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.34,1:42:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.20,1:42:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I had this part in mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.64,1:42:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that scene where Moonsong plays,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.12,1:42:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.84,1:42:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,where you climb the Outer Wall,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.98,1:42:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So about that...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.26,1:42:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I just had to put it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.32,1:42:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.76,1:42:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The music,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.15,1:42:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-So this part was in your head from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.34,1:42:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.11,1:42:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, this part we see here,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.01,1:42:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,this scene in the game,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.94,1:42:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,this... Yeah, the fans seem to have drawn it a lot...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.84,1:42:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah, about this part...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.30,1:42:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Y'know, with other games,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.56,1:42:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,there's uh, quite a few, well,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.16,1:42:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,scenes where the music plays, and you're just staring,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.58,1:42:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.67,1:42:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to try that out myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.01,1:42:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.67,1:42:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and that became what we see there in the game, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.40,1:42:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's how I made this Moonsong scene. And, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.17,1:42:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.79,1:42:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.84,1:42:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,quite a few people lik-
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.84,1:43:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-You could almost say that the whole game was made
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.15,1:43:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,made just to realise this one scene, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.99,1:43:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-...You're right, you know, the motivation came from the music,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.74,1:43:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,from the feeling of wanting to put in that scene, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.08,1:43:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-You mean the development followed from the music?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.63,1:43:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right. Basically,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.91,1:43:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you gotta have some section you really like,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.40,1:43:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.30,1:43:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so you work hard for it, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.92,1:43:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-I've been wondering this for a long time, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.96,1:43:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mimiga, I can pretty much, understand, uh, what they are,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.18,1:43:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mimiga are basically some kind of animal...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.91,1:43:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.32,1:43:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Just what is Balrog?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.96,1:43:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.68,1:43:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-About that...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.59,1:43:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's lots of theories out there, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.36,1:43:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.65,1:43:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.00,1:43:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.46,1:43:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to be soap.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.71,1:43:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.87,1:43:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's {\i1}soap{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.92,1:43:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Before restarting development,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.51,1:43:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you remember those bubble guys we saw for a bit earlier?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.60,1:43:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, in the Alpha version we saw an excerpt of earlier?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.07,1:43:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, that's right. So um, he's supposed to be like...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.14,1:43:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he's like the boss of the soaps, Balrog is.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.62,1:43:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean Puu.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.69,1:43:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And he uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.05,1:43:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The mimiga living in the caves...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.04,1:43:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He uh, he eats them...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.52,1:43:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah, so he was a really bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.12,1:43:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, he was a bad guy, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.68,1:44:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's quite a ??? guy, it does get pretty nasty in the script.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.25,1:44:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, like...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.63,1:44:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,like to the point of morbid,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.48,1:44:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right, like "put them in water" and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.72,1:44:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare Mimiga by putting them in water,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.20,1:44:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and they'll taste better, or stuff like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.53,1:44:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it was, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.20,1:44:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Pretty nasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.47,1:44:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, he wasn't a toaster?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.22,1:44:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, he's not...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.91,1:44:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.06,1:44:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.57,1:44:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you... like soap?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.07,1:44:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, yeah, I like soap.\N-So about Puu...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.16,1:44:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm, so why soap?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.36,1:44:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, the idea of making soap characters...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.36,1:44:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, that's uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.59,1:44:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.48,1:44:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's convenient, see? Uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.99,1:44:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, the collision detection, it...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.72,1:44:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You get what I'm saying, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.46,1:44:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-A-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.92,1:44:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the collision detection, if you use rectangles...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.42,1:44:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.31,1:44:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In every way, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.56,1:44:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, with circular characters,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.64,1:44:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,if something hits the 'corner', it's a problem...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.40,1:44:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I wanted to be able to stand on top of enemies,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.10,1:44:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's how it went...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.06,1:44:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.00,1:44:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.21,1:44:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.16,1:44:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like, I get that,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.47,1:44:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but still, man, soap? Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.82,1:44:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.41,1:44:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, there's that too,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.96,1:44:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,um,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.64,1:44:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So in a 16x16 sprite,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.98,1:44:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.28,1:44:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,if you draw a circle,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.07,1:44:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.50,1:44:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and then just draw a dot in it, it looks like a bubble.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.22,1:45:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And that image of a bubble, I really like it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.52,1:44:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.29,1:45:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.97,1:45:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to make bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.96,1:45:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-So you wanted to make bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.20,1:45:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And so I really...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.74,1:45:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohhh, because it's soap, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.10,1:45:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, it's soap, so it makes bubbles...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.07,1:45:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.80,1:45:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can really feel that roundness in the bubbles,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.14,1:45:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,despite it being pixel art,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.79,1:45:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.63,1:45:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,feel the, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.78,1:45:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Humidity?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.80,1:45:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hum...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.12,1:45:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.36,1:45:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-M-moisture.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.08,1:45:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.40,1:45:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Humidity, hah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.27,1:45:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um, yeah, anyways...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.47,1:45:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So that feeling really came across,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.47,1:45:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so I started spamming bubbles everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.24,1:45:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.22,1:45:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I used a lot of bubbles in Ikachan, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.69,1:45:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.95,1:45:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I like bubbles, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.12,1:45:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right since your student days, no? It's a recurring theme.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.84,1:45:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.09,1:45:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um, yeah, I guess you're right, haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.08,1:45:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hadn't noticed. Also, this is something I'd forgot about,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.52,1:45:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.60,1:45:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,there was this game called Doggy Wyvern,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.04,1:45:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah, yep, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.76,1:45:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a game featuring a dog flying through the air,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.92,1:45:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see, where was this...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.56,1:46:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Where is it...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.07,1:46:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Doggy...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.74,1:46:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was this something you made fairly long ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.54,1:46:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.96,1:46:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is actually from before Ikachan,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.16,1:46:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the time I wasn't worrying about storage capacity,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.74,1:46:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so I made the soundtrack in WAV format,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.05,1:46:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.05,1:46:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is that software you had made for a
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.96,1:46:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,school project, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.21,1:46:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, you're right, yeah. Um,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.62,1:46:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.21,1:46:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a game for a school project?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.87,1:46:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's, well, we formed a group at school,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.87,1:46:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, see, we uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.76,1:46:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and we produced this one game,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.47,1:46:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and - oh, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.68,1:46:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lots of stories behind this thing, hehe.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.42,1:46:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh, the icon looks kind of like King, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.11,1:46:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.02,1:46:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it should work this way...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.08,1:46:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, it's running.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.66,1:46:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.00,1:46:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So in this game, the soundtrack was made with
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.51,1:46:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,a nice music software called XGWorks, by Yamaha.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.98,1:46:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.23,1:46:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and to really let its sound shine,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.23,1:46:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL Note: 'kikaseru' can mean either 'to make someone listen to...' or 'to take advantage of and bring out the best in...'. Both meanings work here, was it a pun?]
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.39,1:46:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-I know about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.62,1:46:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.13,1:46:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved the files in WAV format,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.28,1:46:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,which now meant one song was like 3 MB,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.64,1:46:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.21,1:46:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,which is kinda...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.20,1:47:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see if this runs further...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.73,1:47:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.54,1:47:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.01,1:47:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-This looks neat! What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.87,1:47:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, this is parallax scrolling we have here, and uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.30,1:47:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bubbles!!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.87,1:47:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.88,1:47:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.34,1:47:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.72,1:47:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.12,1:47:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, sure are bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.24,1:47:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-This...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.74,1:47:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's bubbles, huh...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.74,1:47:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten about it, but it was from here,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.88,1:47:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,starting around this time, that I started using bubbles in stuff...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.50,1:47:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-So we actually had to make this game as a team,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.70,1:47:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the sort of project it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.35,1:47:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But in reality, well, the other people in the team...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.12,1:47:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, they didn't really do anything. Pixel worked by himself,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.88,1:47:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and ended up making it all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.41,1:47:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.12,1:47:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckle]
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.96,1:47:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When it was time to present in the huge [exhibition] hall,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.08,1:47:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.20,1:47:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-In the end I wasn't able to finish this, though, various problems came up...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.80,1:47:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.37,1:47:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huuhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.75,1:47:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-But y'know, what I'm seeing here seems plenty.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.99,1:47:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, I'd play it. It's got enough polish already, feels like.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.95,1:47:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.80,1:47:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.63,1:48:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, honestly. It looks really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.56,1:48:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, this is a dog here, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.10,1:48:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A dog flying in the air like that...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.07,1:48:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, that's unthinkable, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.29,1:48:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But in a game...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.00,1:48:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can rush in with enthusiasm,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.32,1:48:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and make what you want. So I made this dog,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.31,1:48:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,this dog that flies through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.15,1:48:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.88,1:48:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, why you're hurling fish, or why the enemies fall apart like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.77,1:48:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea-
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.30,1:48:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.54,1:48:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! And we're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.02,1:48:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,ma ??? game wo...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.28,1:48:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.\N-Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.99,1:48:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you like animals? The Mimiga, too,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.58,1:48:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,now that I think of it, are animals...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.01,1:48:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, animals, huh? Well, ever since I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.96,1:48:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,when drawing a picture, if I think about drawing a human,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.70,1:48:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the clothes, and fingers...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.80,1:48:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.86,1:48:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to draw all that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.03,1:48:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, true.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.94,1:48:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And that, I just can't draw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.81,1:48:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, {\i1}that's{\i0} the reason? That's why animals?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.20,1:48:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-With animals, you don't need to draw clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.73,1:48:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if you do, you can keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.96,1:48:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Like put everyone in a suit or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.21,1:48:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you can get away with not drawing any fingers at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.74,1:48:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, you can just make it all fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.86,1:48:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.64,1:48:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-So yeah, I like animal characters.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.50,1:48:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,??? ma sore mo atte kekkyoku mimiga ya to omoundesuyo
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.79,1:48:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.27,1:49:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd drawn humans, then I'd end up making a game with nothing but humans, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.30,1:49:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.72,1:49:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-I actually, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.90,1:49:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When I played Cave Story for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.12,1:49:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept thinking that a cute character would show up sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.42,1:49:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then as I went on, WHAM, Kazuma showed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.08,1:49:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And then WHAM, Kazuma again.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.45,1:49:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.84,1:49:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.95,1:49:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.96,1:49:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.95,1:49:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.72,1:49:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,tsukutte to wakaranain desu yo ne sono kankaku wa
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.87,1:49:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.\N-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.19,1:49:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.40,1:49:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, I think this is a good place to...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.41,1:49:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.35,1:49:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.\N-Oh, it's been that long?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.36,1:49:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep. Well, it's been, hmm, just about an hour since Part 2 started.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.72,1:49:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh, alright...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.77,1:49:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, shall we have another recess here?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.17,1:49:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.\N-Sure.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.89,1:49:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-So we'll break for ten minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.28,1:49:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and... the finale is Part 3, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.12,1:49:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... What was in Part 3, again? "Cave Story-..."
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.22,1:49:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"...- What Awaits"?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.88,1:49:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the name?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.83,1:49:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wasn't expecting that.\N-Didn't think that would be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.43,1:49:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.94,1:49:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.36,1:49:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, so we'll finish by going through "Cave Story - What Awaits",
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.78,1:49:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and compared to what we've heard so far,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.48,1:50:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.38,1:50:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,well, in Part 3, we'll explore a different angle of the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.32,1:50:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Niconico at-
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.06,1:50:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-WOAH, this is sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.91,1:50:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.44,1:50:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-9,000 viewers out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.57,1:50:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-Ooohhh.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.88,1:50:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wooaahhh.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.00,1:50:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thanks a lot, viewers from online!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.08,1:50:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.30,1:50:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, on the official site, uhh...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.68,1:50:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,right, there was the popularity contest and stuff that was held,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.72,1:50:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and we should be seeing the results of that in Part 3,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.40,1:50:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.\N-Huuhh.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.06,1:50:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.68,1:50:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.08,1:50:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.29,1:50:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.56,1:50:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.03,1:50:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.62,1:50:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Heeyyy!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.55,1:50:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.07,1:50:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lots of "hey"s there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.22,1:50:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Came out delicately, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.64,1:50:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.38,1:50:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.88,1:50:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, so with that, let's take a ten-minute break!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.48,1:50:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're thirsty, folks,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.76,1:50:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's plenty of stuff you can order.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.75,1:50:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.60,1:50:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.56,1:50:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Part 2 has now come to a close.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.29,1:50:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.60,1:50:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.62,1:50:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thanks a bunch, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.43,1:50:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[applause]
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.87,1:50:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Scuse me, can I get a refill?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.90,1:50:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm parched!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.09,2:01:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[INTERVAL]
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.31,2:01:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.60,2:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.36,2:01:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now be starting Part 3, uhh...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.15,2:01:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.66,2:01:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-[murmuring]
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.80,2:01:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.19,2:01:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Umm, okay...?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.75,2:01:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.86,2:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-This?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.77,2:01:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Naramura is the artist, you know...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.59,2:01:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.44,2:01:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to start off Part 3 like this?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.44,2:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Scary.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.15,2:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.36,2:01:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is the introduction?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.90,2:01:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Turns out, Part 3 wasn't about "Cave Story - What Awaits".
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.64,2:01:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, "Cave Story and its People"...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.15,2:01:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.72,2:01:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's redeem ourselves a bit...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.46,2:02:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, this is a nice illustration.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.86,2:02:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.74,2:02:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.26,2:02:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the bind, this scene, no?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.60,2:02:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's cool...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.52,2:02:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one, uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.21,2:02:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew it as part of work.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.89,2:02:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.82,2:02:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.32,2:02:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok, one more.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.42,2:02:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh? Another?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.94,2:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]\N-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.91,2:02:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.26,2:02:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-I put this in again as a prank.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.76,2:02:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.96,2:02:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.55,2:02:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd been thinking I should make some art for this event,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.41,2:02:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,like this one and the previous one, so I started on that...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.08,2:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.39,2:02:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.02,2:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But well, if you go on the internet and look up Cave Story fanart,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.16,2:02:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.72,2:02:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone has the impression that it's a cutesy world.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.17,2:02:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hehe.\N-Yeah, totally.\N-Oh, i-is that so?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.40,2:02:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's how it's drawn. But...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.45,2:02:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you really think about it, aren't these characters...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.95,2:02:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...supposed to be killer robots?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.84,2:02:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.55,2:02:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.92,2:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, you're right, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.72,2:02:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-They're killer robots sent from the Surface,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.80,2:02:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're definitely right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.57,2:02:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ain't that what it's supposed to be like?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.55,2:02:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.88,2:02:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-koiha nanda image shita mono ga attari surun desuka?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.38,2:02:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.94,2:02:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, there's people inside.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.43,2:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.58,2:02:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I put dots all over the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.34,2:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.47,2:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Peepholes?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.49,2:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.11,2:03:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.62,2:03:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, so with that, let's start Part... hah...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.43,2:03:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.08,2:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, is it okay? Starting like this?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.95,2:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's get down to it. Part 3, "Cave Story and its People".
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.50,2:03:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we have, uhh...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.97,2:03:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well. I said this earlier, but
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.25,2:03:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we conducted a popularity contest on the official site.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.49,2:03:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So to begin,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.86,2:03:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,let's announce the results.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.83,2:03:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Should we do introductions again?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.94,2:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.60,2:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.41,2:03:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Heeyy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.48,2:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-???
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.15,2:03:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.68,2:03:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-W-we've got 10,000 viewers online.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.52,2:03:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-10,000? Whew.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.20,2:03:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woaahh.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.18,2:03:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.68,2:03:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.83,2:03:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Y'all really volunteered yourself to attend this?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.70,2:03:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.72,2:03:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.93,2:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? mina san katte idaito tsugi ni tsunagaru to yobare. ??? desu ka ne
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.25,2:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-The next?... Ah.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.28,2:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-True.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.76,2:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.32,2:03:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's a nice thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.34,2:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.72,2:03:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.33,2:03:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, right, um,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.98,2:03:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The drinks, it seems they're almost sold out,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.24,2:03:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.\N-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.78,2:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to try the Toroko for now...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.78,2:03:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, let's try a Toroko.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.24,2:03:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.63,2:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok, then, two Torokos, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.92,2:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, make that three, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.00,2:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Four, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.68,2:03:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
