Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.00,2:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-I think so.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.77,2:04:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the green thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.00,2:04:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-With or without red flowers?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.20,2:04:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.33,2:04:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Without red flowers, I think.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.31,2:04:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Not frenzied, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.52,2:04:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.\N-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.48,2:04:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Anyways, moving on!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.33,2:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let's begin with, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.99,2:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Na...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.96,2:04:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.52,2:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Let's begin", was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.52,2:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.90,2:04:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.51,2:04:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have the Monster popularity poll,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.44,2:04:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,then the Character,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.71,2:04:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and the BGM-
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.54,2:04:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the three popularity polls we ran.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.56,2:04:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.51,2:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the Monster poll.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.42,2:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, right, just gimme a minute...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.03,2:04:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet again, I'm in a hurry and it's taking forever...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.46,2:04:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.44,2:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.57,2:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, I will...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.40,2:04:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-How long were these polls held, and how many participants?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.06,2:04:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-???
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.30,2:04:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Fanart...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.07,2:04:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.95,2:04:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Character popularity poll ran...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.61,2:04:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,About two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.05,2:04:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how long it was held...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.00,2:04:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm, that's how long?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.76,2:04:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.20,2:04:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-And about 500 people responded.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.75,2:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah, that many people?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.22,2:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.99,2:05:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not a lot of people were notified,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.89,2:05:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.88,2:05:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the announcement on Twitter,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.60,2:05:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the first was... that guy,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.84,2:05:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and after that, the bottom spots were in pretty close contest.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.12,2:05:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, at first, it was... Misery vs. Sue.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.87,2:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.43,2:05:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-And there were these two rival factions,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.68,2:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,those saying "Misery is cute!",
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.11,2:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and those saying "Sue is irresistible!" - these groups were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.60,2:05:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]\N-Irresistible?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.39,2:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-And then, in there,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.40,2:05:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you had Balrog swooping in with a "Hey!".
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.61,2:05:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.88,2:05:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Balrog, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.81,2:05:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-So there was a three-way struggle in the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.08,2:05:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.50,2:05:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.09,2:05:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, no matter how it actually turns out,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.30,2:05:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,please enjoy the results.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.28,2:05:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, true. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.27,2:05:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.70,2:05:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep. C'mon, show us the Monster results.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.22,2:05:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh, hold on a sec...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.96,2:05:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.88,2:05:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,kore hanashi na norasaki??? no kekkou muzukashii ne
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.95,2:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-tsunagu tame ni maou, ageta no ni, jibun ga shabete-
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.25,2:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Monsters...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.92,2:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whoa, woops.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.70,2:05:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, alrightie, let's do this...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.61,2:05:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-What were the monsters, again?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.52,2:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-The monsters, huh...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.24,2:05:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-boku mo ???
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.72,2:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah. When I took a look at hisuto???
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.24,2:05:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought, woah, there's that many?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.64,2:05:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckles]\N-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.41,2:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It surprised me, even.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.90,2:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's about 50~60 in all, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.72,2:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.27,2:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.75,2:06:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-de ko kaito suru shimo zenbu oboeteno kanaa to shiginimisu san kedo
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.93,2:06:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-I don't think a single person would know the names.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.01,2:06:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, there are. And-
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.10,2:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, for a monster popularity poll,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.16,2:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's good enough to just have known monsters on there.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.10,2:06:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.74,2:06:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.51,2:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are we ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.68,2:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.48,2:06:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok, shall we start from #5?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.91,2:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We have #5 to #1 all lined up, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.60,2:06:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.07,2:06:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we have... #5!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.36,2:06:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-#5!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.55,2:06:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-#5!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.96,2:06:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,#5 from the monsters...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.56,2:06:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-This dude!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.64,2:06:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]\N-Ah...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.03,2:06:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.00,2:06:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-This thing's a monster?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.14,2:06:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.72,2:06:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, uh...\N-This is a b-
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.82,2:06:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of the bosses, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.13,2:06:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.87,2:06:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-A mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.70,2:06:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.34,2:06:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's small, but it jumps around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.90,2:06:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it too.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.56,2:06:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wonder how many players this thing killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.01,2:06:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-A whole lot, I'd guess.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.38,2:06:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.45,2:06:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really strong.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.28,2:06:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Once you kill it, it's an item, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.06,2:06:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.92,2:06:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.50,2:06:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Should it even have been in the poll?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.23,2:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, yeah, it's an item.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.84,2:06:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Though that's a spoiler...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.20,2:06:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, but,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.27,2:06:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not a monster you'd fight normally, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.55,2:06:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who picked this,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.31,2:06:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,must be the ones who actually fought it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.31,2:06:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.34,2:06:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.04,2:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.29,2:06:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listening to this conversation...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.80,2:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.28,2:07:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on, #4!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.33,2:07:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yessir, #4...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.23,2:07:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.23,2:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-If you will.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.62,2:07:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Critter!\N-Critter!\N-Critter!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.87,2:07:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, this one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.67,2:07:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Looks nothing like what you drew back there!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.64,2:07:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Critters...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.80,2:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.20,2:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-This...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.19,2:07:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If it'd really looked like this, heh,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.19,2:07:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it probably wouldn't have been #4, haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.97,2:07:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.94,2:07:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-This thing, oh man...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.85,2:07:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is colour mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.20,2:07:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's various... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.57,2:07:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, the colour...?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.84,2:07:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Critters are pretty popular, huh...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.60,2:07:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.20,2:07:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-I guess it was green.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.95,2:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one though, often comes in groups...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.04,2:07:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Doesn't this... appear in different places with different colours?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.20,2:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, right,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.92,2:07:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them are critters.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.92,2:07:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are they all critters?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.24,2:07:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.71,2:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The big ones are Power Critters.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.20,2:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And power... well,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.36,2:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,they're bigger in size.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.85,2:07:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.16,2:07:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.60,2:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one was #4, huh...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.31,2:07:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to #3.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.29,2:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-They show up again and again, so they make a strong impression.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.96,2:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-You can say everyone knows them, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.88,2:07:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-They can be pretty unpleasant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.89,2:07:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, if you shoot, then they jump...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.64,2:07:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.55,2:07:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.37,2:07:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, then, #3...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.86,2:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yessir, coming right up, #3...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.84,2:07:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-If you will.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.81,2:07:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ta-da.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.60,2:07:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oohhhh.\N-Ohhhhh.\N-Ooohhhh.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.39,2:07:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Boss ga hajimete,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.56,2:07:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,??? ah mappi ni omomokousa mitai na mono ka
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.51,2:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.88,2:08:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is another boss that's... pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.95,2:08:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-This boss...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.16,2:08:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It has quite an impression on the story's flow, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.12,2:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, you feel bad for the situation here...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.12,2:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.34,2:08:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Me too, when I got to this point in the game,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.39,2:08:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.00,2:08:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Foroo nai janai desuka
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.97,2:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.37,2:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.12,2:08:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-jibun ???
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.59,2:08:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. When she dies,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.46,2:08:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,she just disappears without saying a word...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.63,2:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.66,2:08:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.79,2:08:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.\N-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.67,2:08:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been through so much, and in the end...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.51,2:08:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-King actually has a line there, if only "Oww" or something...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.68,2:08:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-kore demo touji kara, ichiban saisho kara, mou noun??? dattan desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.24,2:08:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh...\N-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.19,2:08:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, it was like, "what now?"
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.44,2:08:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,bokura mo minna, kore wa moun??? no hou ga zettai
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.04,2:08:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,mou kokoro ni sasatte
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.02,2:08:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.71,2:08:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.35,2:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-kanfa??? demo koitsu dake naranai
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.88,2:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-naranai
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.46,2:08:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-sou desu ne
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.65,2:08:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-ah sasuga ni demo ???
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.05,2:08:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.61,2:08:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,nanimo nai dayo??? taoshimashita tte
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.09,2:08:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,sore wa chotto ???
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.23,2:08:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-itteba kotae wa??? nandomo nandomo taoshimashita
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.16,2:08:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.76,2:08:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was painful.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.86,2:08:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, that tracks...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.16,2:08:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-But you know, all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.49,2:08:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the tone of the story changed here.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.41,2:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.79,2:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, ???
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.51,2:08:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-And then, with that sadness still fresh,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.64,2:08:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you walk outside, and Balrog's theme starts playing.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.26,2:09:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.84,2:09:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Totally changes the mood, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.24,2:09:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Jumps you from above, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.84,2:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.03,2:09:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, so, let's move on to #2?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.70,2:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep. #2, coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.12,2:09:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, huh...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.13,2:09:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-A Night Spirit, eh...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.80,2:09:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, this huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.04,2:09:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-This one seems a bit different, no?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.04,2:09:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.88,2:09:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-This thing is...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.72,2:09:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,kinda...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.31,2:09:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a small fry, basically.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.75,2:09:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.72,2:09:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bit big for a small fry, no?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.84,2:09:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.08,2:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, the sprite is bigger than Balrog, I think.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.65,2:09:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is this...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.85,2:09:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a cat?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.70,2:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is this, actually?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.98,2:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-What indeed... A ghost?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.93,2:09:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried drawing a ghost, but...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.92,2:09:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The shape of the head does seem fit for a cat...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.42,2:09:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.24,2:09:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Fit for a cat, hehe.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.48,2:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-I do like this sort of shape for cats, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.64,2:09:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, wait, isn't this what you'd been wanting to draw at the start?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.88,2:09:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.34,2:09:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going outside for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.57,2:09:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.04,2:09:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that scene. This character wasn't yet conceived, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.60,2:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-I think I first had Moonsong, and that scene,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.75,2:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.24,2:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and then chose this character based on that.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.48,2:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.72,2:09:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-I think choosing this for #2 sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.44,2:09:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Had you planned on putting these in from the start?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.46,2:09:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Eh, um...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.85,2:09:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this isn't...!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.44,2:09:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.07,2:10:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just climbing up felt a little bland by way of design...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.47,2:10:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-So these... yeah, kinda,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.57,2:10:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hence these flying enemies...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.44,2:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I put them there to challenge you.\NThere wasn't anything there, at first.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.14,2:10:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.44,2:10:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.28,2:10:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-If this is #2, then what might...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.11,2:10:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...what might #1 be?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.97,2:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-o sou totsuka nai deshou
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.77,2:10:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-#1 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.07,2:10:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-#1 is...?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.14,2:10:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,haha, sou totsukanai desuka ne
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.35,2:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, #1...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.66,2:10:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think it's made an appearance yet, has it?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.08,2:10:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, guess not.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.92,2:10:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.48,2:10:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, for #1, let's get some fanfare!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.93,2:10:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that so?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.32,2:10:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.09,2:10:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-[drum roll]
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.72,2:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.41,2:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-And now, coming in at #1, is...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.20,2:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster X!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.74,2:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.01,2:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oohh...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.25,2:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woahh!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.72,2:10:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.51,2:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-So it's this...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.91,2:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-So it's this?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.26,2:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-So it's this!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.66,2:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-So it's this.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.30,2:10:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.27,2:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.44,2:10:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-You say you liked this?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.41,2:10:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.\N-I see, huh!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.29,2:10:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-So this guy, I think...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.05,2:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I think a fair few people gave up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.15,2:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.\N-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.92,2:10:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-It can be hard to figure out the weak point.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.84,2:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-For sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.81,2:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Its HP doesn't decrease in the beginning, until you destroy those...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.66,2:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.46,2:11:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, honestly, this guy is...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.26,2:11:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-It does kinda make you panic at first, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.71,2:11:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-kawaii tekita cho shibaite mattetara totsuzen ???
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.00,2:11:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.91,2:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasted like, an hour-
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.80,2:11:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...no sorry, a month, on its movement.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.56,2:11:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah, it took that long?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.93,2:11:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-I spent quite some time drawing a caterpillar-like motion,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.39,2:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm pretty happy this was #1 on the poll...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.41,2:11:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,even though it doesn't talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.69,2:11:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's pretty subtle, huh? Now that I see it I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:26.03,2:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but caterpillars move kinda diagonally...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.95,2:11:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah uh, you try it out, and you can tell diagonal makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.55,2:11:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a pain...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.51,2:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-When you defeat it, an animal pops out, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.16,2:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, a cat pops out.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.23,2:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.38,2:11:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-What indeed, I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.47,2:11:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.92,2:11:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I kinda just made it on a whim,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.92,2:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even really have an explanation to myself. And a lot of things,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.53,2:11:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-So that cat...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.83,2:11:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.29,2:11:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat... where and why does it enter the machine?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.88,2:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, you know how a Bakeneko transforms its appearance using magic...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.88,2:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: A Bakeneko is a shapeshifting cat-like spirit in Japanese mythology.]
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.51,2:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.16,2:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, right, I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.93,2:11:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, I guess it's magic?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.47,2:12:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.66,2:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.22,2:12:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-You just came up with that, didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.65,2:12:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't just make stuff up!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.52,2:12:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.09,2:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, so the cat's not inside?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.80,2:12:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.40,2:12:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The machine transforms?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.58,2:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-This stage was a labyrinth built to protect the Core within,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.51,2:12:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.56,2:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.40,2:12:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that, Monster X was, uh, established,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.76,2:12:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Established, haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.47,2:12:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-established as a mysterious machine.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.37,2:12:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was basically completed in that order, was it?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.43,2:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh...\N-That's right...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.56,2:12:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if it's not a swords-and-sorcery kind of world,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.72,2:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.19,2:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,if you see something funny like that out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.74,2:12:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.59,2:12:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that's just sloppy, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.71,2:12:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-The boss's, what do you say, um, action...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.10,2:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The way it follows you, and reverses,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.04,2:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the projectiles that fly around...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.24,2:12:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have any other ideas in mind when designing this boss?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.22,2:12:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.74,2:12:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, when I was making it, I didn't think of anything beyond what you see now.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:39.92,2:12:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.48,2:12:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, as for why this got to #1,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.24,2:12:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure it's cuz of the trauma it gave everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.80,2:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So during the questionnaire, in the comments,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.08,2:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah right, I mentioned it would be good to leave comments too if possible,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.69,2:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.04,2:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.28,2:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.16,2:12:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and every last one of them said Monster X gave them trauma.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.93,2:12:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.69,2:12:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.38,2:12:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.69,2:13:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.78,2:13:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.29,2:13:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-So with that, let's...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.24,2:13:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.08,2:13:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.63,2:13:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, to continue,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.28,2:13:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we go with the BGM or the Character poll?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.58,2:13:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I think going with BGM would be...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.53,2:13:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah. Let's save Character for last...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.62,2:13:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's save Character for last.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.45,2:13:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.87,2:13:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-I've got BGM lined up already, so...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.74,2:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, go ahead then.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.99,2:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.92,2:13:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-sono kain wa chotto tsunagi itaraite desu???
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.14,2:13:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.48,2:13:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.16,2:13:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-The BGM, well... I really like it, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.08,2:13:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and I just couldn't choose from it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.60,2:13:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.52,2:13:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.27,2:13:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, true... This poll doesn't ask for just one favourite, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.09,2:13:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.73,2:13:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.77,2:13:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh, well..
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.31,2:13:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is better,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.56,2:13:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, compared to just picking your favourite,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.54,2:13:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.22,2:13:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.42,2:13:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you're selecting multiple songs that you like, at once...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.88,2:13:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.65,2:13:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Niconico Live is kinda blowing up now...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.52,2:13:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Last Battle's popular, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.68,2:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, Grasstown - I like Grasstown, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.14,2:13:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah.\N-Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.60,2:13:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.11,2:13:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-I like the theme from, uh, Snack.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.28,2:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.44,2:13:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Which?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.06,2:13:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.46,2:13:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh, Snack is, um...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.52,2:13:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, Snack.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.57,2:13:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from the stage where you meet Curly Brace.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.95,2:13:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohhh, yeah! I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.50,2:13:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: Snack as in Snack Bar/Cocktail Bar, i.e. Sand Zone Residence]
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.06,2:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.26,2:13:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cockroach Theme', someone says...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.59,2:14:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, hahaha.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.35,2:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that would be the characters' location...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.80,2:14:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.63,2:14:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, the cockroaches, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.92,2:14:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.36,2:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The cockroaches, well, the labyrinth...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.36,2:14:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.67,2:14:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Looking at the comments here,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.61,2:14:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.67,2:14:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Last Battle and Running Hell...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.21,2:14:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,shuuman no kkosen shita omoide aru tokoro wa tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.79,2:14:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahhh, hmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.25,2:14:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-I guess those game-like songs that get your blood pumping are fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.60,2:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Game tracks are definitely,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.32,2:14:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,asonda kaisu stage ja nankai ???
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.50,2:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes. When you look at what songs are popular,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.33,2:14:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,ramura toka theme ???
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.43,2:14:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,attan sa ranking de???
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.60,2:14:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-The songs that get popular are usually the starting ones,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.86,2:14:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The songs that you hear a lot grow on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.03,2:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-and the ones you hear so much, they give you trauma.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.60,2:14:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,kikasatatte??? iu kansou de
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.65,2:14:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, it's all ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.84,2:14:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.40,2:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then let's start with #5.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.77,2:14:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we playing the songs too?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.18,2:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, we are playing them.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.44,2:14:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, cool, let's have fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.03,2:14:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.72,2:14:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, then, #5...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.14,2:14:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're starting with #5.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.68,2:14:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,#5 is this song:
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.50,2:14:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[Main Theme plays]
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.68,2:14:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.91,2:14:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.79,2:14:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, this is #5.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.15,2:14:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-I've heard this so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.32,2:14:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, the idea was, you listen to it on the title screen,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.32,2:15:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and then later when you get to the stage it plays in-game, you're like, oh that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.13,2:15:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.75,2:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've used this method since Ikachan, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.88,2:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.64,2:15:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikachan's title screen theme also shows up in the endgame there,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.43,2:15:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.23,2:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes for a nice feeling.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.06,2:15:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.95,2:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So just this song-
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.93,2:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-It plays when the place is crumbling, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.58,2:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This song is really long, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.16,2:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.58,2:15:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.51,2:15:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet there's a lot of people who liste-\Nwho didn't listen to the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.08,2:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-It played earlier, just before we started this event,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.06,2:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.59,2:15:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't play the whole song, though,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.56,2:15:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.59,2:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard a little, I think.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.61,2:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.28,2:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The melody at the end of the song is amazing, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.16,2:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-I...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.86,2:15:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's kinda sloppy...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.53,2:15:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wondered if the Plantation theme was a different version or something.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.86,2:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.23,2:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.66,2:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-The title screen's theme...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.88,2:15:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The song changes...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.64,2:15:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-You immediately press 'Continue' at the title screen.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.37,2:15:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only hear the prelude, basically.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.59,2:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.00,2:15:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.07,2:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to #4, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.00,2:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.33,2:15:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.32,2:15:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh... one moment if you will...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.68,2:15:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's see what #4 might be...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.70,2:15:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, #4... This is definitely a trauma song, eh.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.69,2:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.70,2:15:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-And what do you mean by that...?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.08,2:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-I should really go easier on you guys...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:55.36,2:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.54,2:15:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, #4, coming up!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.29,2:15:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.35,2:16:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,#4 is... this song:
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.80,2:16:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[Running Hell plays]
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.85,2:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.33,2:16:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.70,2:16:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's with this-
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.28,2:16:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, this tracks.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.25,2:16:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.71,2:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh man, I did this too.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.71,2:16:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-This stage was made such that it's fine if you don't clear it...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.24,2:16:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.00,2:16:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Man, how many times have I heard this song by now?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.71,2:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.97,2:16:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Honestly, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.54,2:16:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was playing, I probably listened to this for like,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.50,2:16:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,ten hours, or thereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.91,2:16:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.82,2:16:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-And thus traumatised, I had some questions for Amaya-san.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.00,2:16:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.46,2:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, actually, I got a lot of questions on my BBS, saying, "Is it ok if I can't clear this stage?"
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.40,2:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.54,2:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So I felt the need to say,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.28,2:16:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that yeah, it's fine if you don't clear it.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.96,2:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And my sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.71,2:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.70,2:16:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is hard...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.68,2:16:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.77,2:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-???\N-???
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.00,2:16:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-So in the DSi version, you can choose your difficulty, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.03,2:16:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.56,2:16:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, to be honest, if I were playing the DSi version,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.90,2:16:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,on Normal mode, with the red cap,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.25,2:16:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,???
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.25,2:16:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is because in Easy mode, with the yellow cap,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.23,2:17:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,toriaezu clear dekiru n de, boka??? debug sore de yattemashita
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.63,2:17:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.24,2:17:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.21,2:17:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending made ikeru wake desu ne
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.97,2:17:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.36,2:17:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.70,2:17:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.26,2:17:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's that hard, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.24,2:17:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.64,2:17:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.20,2:17:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Shall we move on to #3?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.43,2:17:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's move on, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.26,2:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.64,2:17:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm... #3...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.72,2:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,#3, was it... Ah, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.65,2:17:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Moonsong hasn't shown up yet, huh...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:18.46,2:17:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-What rank is Moonsong at? Probably #1, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.56,2:17:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-There was a lot of talk of Moonsong on Twitter, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:23.82,2:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's also been a lot of people remixing Moonsong.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.51,2:17:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huhhh...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.05,2:17:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, here it is...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.85,2:17:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.83,2:17:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then... #3 is this song:
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.95,2:17:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[Last Battle plays]
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.50,2:17:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.11,2:17:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.65,2:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this one was mentioned earlier,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:38.65,2:17:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,on Niconico. This is Last Battle.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.16,2:17:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:43.44,2:17:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the final battle is where you'd be most pumped up.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.23,2:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.64,2:17:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes sense players who cleared this part would like this song.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.96,2:17:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.64,2:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-While making the game,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.47,2:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't really think about how tired I was making the player near the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.08,2:17:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.77,2:17:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-You think about stuff like that as a gamedev?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.86,2:18:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-I didn't think about it, no...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.57,2:18:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time they clear the game, they must be dripping with sweat...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.21,2:18:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just instakill them right after, haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.83,2:18:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:18:07.76,2:18:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-sore wa gigono??? no yarikata janai
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.76,2:18:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, I mean, this sorta thing, like...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.66,2:18:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's true, it's pretty sudden...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:12.89,2:18:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's just one battle after another, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.05,2:18:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the video, before this,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.71,2:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,just before the Las- the final fight,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:21.18,2:18:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,when you fight Misery and the Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.12,2:18:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no health refills, right,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.72,2:18:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.57,2:18:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so by the time you get to the next fight,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:28.97,2:18:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,your head's drooping the whole time...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.00,2:18:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.97,2:18:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.71,2:18:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like, "Man, I've had enough of this..."
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.20,2:18:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-"What am I even doing here?"
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.69,2:18:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, y'know, I bet a lot of people were like,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.27,2:18:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"I've got work tomorrow, but I'm gonna keep going till I beat this boss."
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.95,2:18:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.21,2:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'll play until morning,"
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.59,2:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,or like, "asa ga ??? tsukou toshite tachiagaru".
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.80,2:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.32,2:18:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-So thanks to stuff like that, you'd hear this song
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.04,2:18:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,over and over again, and come to like it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.92,2:18:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I think.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.69,2:18:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.16,2:18:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah. So...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.10,2:18:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, so, #5 was the Title Theme,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.16,2:18:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and #4 was...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.39,2:19:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the super difficult final stage that requires certain conditions to unlock,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.84,2:19:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and #3 was Last Battle.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.88,2:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now #2 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.20,2:19:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-#2 is... What, indeed?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.17,2:19:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-#2 is...?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.84,2:19:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh let's see, it's...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.41,2:19:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Puu...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.73,2:19:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, y'know, my...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.46,2:19:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-My favourite song hasn't shown up yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.98,2:19:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-That so?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:13.26,2:19:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-#2, hmmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.29,2:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ikeya-san, which song do you like?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.58,2:19:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:19.12,2:19:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it'll show up, but my favourite's gotta be...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.60,2:19:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Egg Corridor.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.21,2:19:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.25,2:19:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, in the ending, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.84,2:19:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it plays at the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.28,2:19:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.48,2:19:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm, on to #2...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.28,2:19:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.55,2:19:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, #2 is this song:
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.80,2:19:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[Mischievous Robot plays]
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.67,2:19:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.10,2:19:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.60,2:19:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Showed up, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.28,2:19:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.89,2:19:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-???
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.65,2:19:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.53,2:19:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-This song is titled Mischievous Robot, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.52,2:19:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.35,2:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a really bright, upbeat song,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.56,2:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.12,2:19:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and based on that mood, I called it Mischievous Robot.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.08,2:19:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but this also shows up during the end credits.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.47,2:19:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:50.88,2:19:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.82,2:19:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, this song-
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.01,2:19:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, this one too is quite...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.47,2:19:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.32,2:19:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-So the song came first after all, and then the name...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.52,2:19:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-You'd think the song'd just be called "Egg Corridor" too...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.49,2:19:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-I mean, if you started with the title...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.12,2:20:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right.\N-Ah, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.04,2:20:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when I made this song, the level wasn't completed yet,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.43,2:20:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,this much I remember.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.31,2:20:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh...\N-I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.19,2:20:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, another thing, uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.77,2:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,when you go to Egg Corridor a second time, when it's all destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.65,2:20:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,initially, this song played there too.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.65,2:20:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hahaha.\N-Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.37,2:20:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-And that upbeat tune's playing, but the dragons are all like, "Roaarrr!"
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.92,2:20:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ehh...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.81,2:20:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And we were like, yeah okay, maybe this is kinda weird...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.23,2:20:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the BGM there was remade, more sombre.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.16,2:20:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.03,2:20:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? ichiyou sono shussei mo atte
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.84,2:20:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.70,2:20:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,ima kekkou pittari ??? desukedo
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.16,2:20:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.03,2:20:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.44,2:20:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.27,2:20:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm happy that this song showed up.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.14,2:20:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]\N-Ahaha.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.39,2:20:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I wonder what #1 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.16,2:20:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.48,2:20:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay then, #1...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.85,2:20:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.15,2:20:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Drumroll, folks.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.09,2:20:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.38,2:20:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes please.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.92,2:20:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's here, it's here...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.91,2:20:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[Drum roll]
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.56,2:20:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, #1 in the BGM popularity poll is this song:
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.34,2:20:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[Moonsong plays]
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.96,2:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.35,2:20:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.44,2:20:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.28,2:20:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-[applause]
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.33,2:21:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.33,2:21:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, this song...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.95,2:21:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm happy too, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.09,2:21:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Amaya-san mo, suteyattari??? janai desu ka kore wa
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.52,2:21:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, true... I am glad that this song was popular.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.05,2:21:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Truly...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.32,2:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This song is mo gyatta???
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.20,2:21:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Folks in the audience here mostly know, I'm sure,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.88,2:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but for anyone who hasn't seen it before,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.04,2:21:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's from fairly late in the game,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.21,2:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,uhh, this scene here, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.81,2:21:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.01,2:21:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.16,2:21:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until this point, Cave Story has been happening within caves,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:25.07,2:21:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but now you see the moon suspended in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.61,2:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the clouds drifting past at great speed,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.12,2:21:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Night Spirits from earlier floating after you...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.02,2:21:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wonderful, dream-like scene.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.52,2:21:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the background, this song, Moonsong, plays.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.40,2:21:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Will you abandon the island, or will you stay and fight?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.66,2:21:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where you make that choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.63,2:21:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.06,2:21:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit more of a... serious point in the story.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.36,2:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:49.53,2:21:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-So earlier, uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.13,2:21:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,when I was corresponding with you on Twitter,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.66,2:21:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you were saying basically you made Cave Story for the sake of this song?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.07,2:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.17,2:22:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, in the version from before the development reset, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.29,2:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this scene was actually there, along with the song.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:03.21,2:22:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.72,2:22:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is also the path that leads to the, uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.66,2:22:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the Plantation, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.73,2:22:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.49,2:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.82,2:22:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You follow this path and come to the Plantation. And well, this place...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.36,2:22:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, the development reset occurred
Dialogue: 0,2:22:14.08,2:22:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,right around the beginning of the mid - no, endgame.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.21,2:22:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.55,2:22:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Cave Story has a lot of variety in its soundtrack, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.12,2:22:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-True... Like here, it feels empty, and the tone changes.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.64,2:22:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Like, there aren't any action scenes with a quiet song.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.12,2:22:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that's true, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:26.28,2:22:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Songs all have a place.\N-Hmm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.79,2:22:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-I guess you're right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.80,2:22:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-But honestly, yeah. It was with this song,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.28,2:22:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,with this image in mind, that uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:35.42,2:22:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that Cave Story was developed, basically.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.58,2:22:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In that sense, it's a very symbolic scene.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.08,2:22:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-True...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.90,2:22:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only fitting, then, that it took first place.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.30,2:22:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.32,2:22:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. Moving on...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.02,2:22:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's proceed to the Character poll, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.02,2:22:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, let me get it ready, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.50,2:22:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, then, another visit to... Niconico Live!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.28,2:22:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.04,2:22:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.16,2:22:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Heyy!\N-Heeyyy!!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.65,2:22:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.41,2:22:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, they're not here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.76,2:22:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Big upset.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.45,2:22:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's with 'em?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.46,2:22:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, they're here, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.28,2:23:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.29,2:23:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wow, cool...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.29,2:23:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Some sort of pattern hiding in there...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.39,2:23:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.22,2:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why exactly does he say "Hey"?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.22,2:23:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: He's referring to Balrog, whose catchphrase in the original script is just "Hey!"]
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.88,2:23:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:08.46,2:23:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh... Hmm. Yeah, why does he? I don't remember...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.02,2:23:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.22,2:23:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-I just put it in at first,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:13.90,2:23:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and then didn't really have a reason to change it...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.00,2:23:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine inspiration, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.76,2:23:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Divine inspiration? Lol.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.38,2:23:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-That divine element was pretty strong, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:23.61,2:23:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with passengers, he isn't fazed.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:25.56,2:23:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, when developing,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.32,2:23:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but see aspects that needed more work.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:29.15,2:23:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:29.93,2:23:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, when I look back on it myself, I do think it's a good game.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:32.75,2:23:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.61,2:23:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,tabun demo sore wa no jibou no naka no sekaikan ga yappari
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.59,2:23:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,arete no shikkari shiteru kara to omoun desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.62,2:23:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,soko kara nori ga atte mo burenain desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,2:23:41.18,2:23:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, does he...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.19,2:23:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he normally talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.46,2:23:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.89,2:23:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, exactly, he's always been like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.92,2:23:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Saying "Hey!" as an introduction?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.89,2:23:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Meaning...?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.56,2:23:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.58,2:23:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, no, no, I myself, sonna page no ???
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.26,2:23:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm, although, sometimes he breaks down.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.90,2:23:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:23:54.91,2:23:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-The text can be pretty weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:56.67,2:23:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.53,2:23:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh, that's probably because...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.53,2:23:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? da to omoimasu
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.64,2:24:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I suck.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.08,2:24:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Y'know, I kinda wanted to do a popularity poll for the text, too...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:04.41,2:24:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.47,2:24:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-So about the text, the script was compiled and put together,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.06,2:24:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,by some people on the site,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.52,2:24:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.80,2:24:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-In the dialogue...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:10.72,2:24:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-serifu chuu arunde omoshi??? naka chance ga areba ne
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.92,2:24:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,??? chance kedo mo
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.25,2:24:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,serifu ranking toka zehi zehi toka timing deatte itadakitai nano omoimasu
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.01,2:24:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-What does Ma Pignon say when you defeat him, again?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.36,2:24:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-He says something funny, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:23.76,2:24:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh yeah, he does.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:24.80,2:24:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-{\i1}After{\i0} defeat?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.72,2:24:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-After defeat.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.46,2:24:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Not "Aah!" or something?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.55,2:24:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-sonna ??? janakute
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.09,2:24:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-"You want to eat me?!" was already pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:32.54,2:24:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.55,2:24:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha, true, definitely. It was a bit of a...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:36.59,2:24:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.02,2:24:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was some loopy dialogue.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.79,2:24:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.09,2:24:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-True.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.60,2:24:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Monologue?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:39.12,2:24:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, just straight-up, no lead in, no small talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.56,2:24:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-And then he's like, "Die!!" at the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.91,2:24:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-I just saw Balrog saying "Hey!" float past onscreen.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.85,2:24:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really?\N-You did?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.24,2:24:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Look, look, here.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.05,2:24:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: This is a Balrog ASCII art emoticon that was sent in the comments: [ ¢_¢ ]ノHey! ]
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.05,2:24:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.45,2:24:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooh.\N-Oh you're right.\N-Here, see?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.86,2:24:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, ichikyou de???
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.35,2:24:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.33,2:24:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.36,2:24:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, so... There were various...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.62,2:24:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.61,2:24:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.56,2:25:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.56,2:25:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TL note: For context, the Balrog emoticon was now repeatedly reproduced in the comments.]
Dialogue: 0,2:25:00.24,2:25:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:01.07,2:25:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is super cool. That's the thing with Niconico,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.20,2:25:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,this aspect of it, it's like a meeting ground of sorts,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.93,2:25:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.15,2:25:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it brings people together...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.52,2:25:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.22,2:25:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.62,2:25:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, guys, you can go easy now!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.93,2:25:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:25:13.58,2:25:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whew. So with that,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:15.07,2:25:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,if things are ready...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.67,2:25:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep. Let's move on to the Character poll.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.21,2:25:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.56,2:25:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh right, let's.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:18.35,2:25:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.68,2:25:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, I almost forgot we were doing the poll thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.81,2:25:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Okay, okay, I get it, lol.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.58,2:25:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.76,2:25:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright! Character popularity poll...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:27.21,2:25:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...Wait, how many characters were there, again?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.96,2:25:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is again a large category, eh?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.69,2:25:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-There were quite a few, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.45,2:25:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-There are, also, I forgot to put him in the questionnaire.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.16,2:25:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-The protagonist?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.00,2:25:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, I forgot the protagonist and some others.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.68,2:25:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.04,2:25:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, we good to go?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.68,2:25:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, let's start.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.68,2:25:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-#5...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.51,2:25:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-#5.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.59,2:25:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, please...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.50,2:25:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, #5 in popularity from the Cave Story cast is...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.30,2:25:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the protagonist...\N-Oh! It's the protagonist!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.85,2:25:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Even though you forgot to put him in?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.76,2:25:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-azukki??? kara ne nandaro
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.73,2:25:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do this to him?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.85,2:25:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Woah there.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.36,2:25:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-The protagonist...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.60,2:25:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really taking the dialogue into consideration.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:55.48,2:25:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.56,2:25:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-You forget about the protagonist's existence, right? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.98,2:26:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing special-
Dialogue: 0,2:26:00.96,2:26:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In the normal - the first route, his name isn't even revealed,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:04.80,2:26:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he's quite a forgettable character...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.46,2:26:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Heck, the popularity poll,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:08.52,2:26:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he probably forgot about it, like Nakamura-san did.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:11.55,2:26:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm, if Nakamura hadn't forgotten, would he have placed higher?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.20,2:26:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.73,2:26:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... who knows...?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:15.77,2:26:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah but you know, as the creator,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:17.55,2:26:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it should be kept in mind that the protagonist is, after all, just the player,
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.93,2:26:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.62,2:26:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.85,2:26:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm kind of like, well, I guess I'm glad he didn't place first.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.95,2:26:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:25.77,2:26:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, let's move on to #4...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.63,2:26:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, so from here it'll be, uh, the previously-mentioned-
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.24,2:26:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the result of the three-way battle, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:32.36,2:26:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yes, I wonder how it'll turn out.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.52,2:26:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright. Uhh, three-way battle...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.20,2:26:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Number...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:37.18,2:26:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,First and last chance?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.17,2:26:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.48,2:26:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's see, we have #4 here. #4 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.91,2:26:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:43.15,2:26:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, Misery.\N-It's Misery.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.33,2:26:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-You guys sound miserable! That tracks.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.25,2:26:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.11,2:26:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-No energy?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:49.34,2:26:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, Misery hagane???
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.40,2:26:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.25,2:26:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-What kind of character is Misery?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.94,2:26:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, what kind of character is she... Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.79,2:26:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A sadist...
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.10,2:27:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...kind of person?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.10,2:27:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.74,2:27:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-She's someone who's lived in the cave for a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:04.92,2:27:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, um,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.72,2:27:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In the old version, there was a character called Oscar, who was really brutal,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.31,2:27:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:09.98,2:27:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and that character, well,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.19,2:27:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it remained, now as this evil witch.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:14.01,2:27:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm, hm.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:15.32,2:27:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Before the development reset, Misery was actually,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:17.74,2:27:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,she was actually an ally, you know. Uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.96,2:27:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And well, Sue, Quote, Misery, and also a Professor,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.81,2:27:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,these four people have a photograph together,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:27.87,2:27:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:28.83,2:27:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,this evil character, Oscar,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:31.68,2:27:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,his soul kind of remained in this character [Misery].
Dialogue: 0,2:27:34.33,2:27:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:36.32,2:27:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was #4.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.00,2:27:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.40,2:27:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:38.17,2:27:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-And so with that said, #3 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.71,2:27:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright then, #3 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:41.45,2:27:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:41.98,2:27:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's proceed to #3.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:43.66,2:27:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,#3 is this character:
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.21,2:27:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-[inhale]
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.60,2:27:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-HEY!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.28,2:27:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.91,2:27:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's you!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.17,2:27:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Made an appearance midway, I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:49.76,2:27:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:50.59,2:27:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-The soap appears.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.71,2:27:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.54,2:27:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see, yep.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:54.06,2:27:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:54.97,2:27:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,he is pretty popular, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.11,2:27:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.62,2:27:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,--Uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.64,2:27:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that he's supposed to be soap,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.36,2:28:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but the... rim... around his face...?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:02.00,2:28:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I kinda... uh, made that so the soap doesn't drip...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:05.76,2:28:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:06.16,2:28:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-His predecessor didn't have a rim, it was smooth...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:07.31,2:28:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-He didn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:07.95,2:28:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-He didn't, it was all smooth, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:09.84,2:28:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-Also, his hands...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:11.10,2:28:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,His hands come out of a slit...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:12.40,2:28:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-The slit, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:13.48,2:28:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's with that?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.62,2:28:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I never really thought about it too hard, tbh.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:16.62,2:28:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]\N-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:28:18.72,2:28:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I just kinda...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.32,2:28:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:21.00,2:28:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He...! Uh, he needs a slit for his hands to move around properly... I guess?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.22,2:28:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.73,2:28:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-And suddenly you have a reason, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.39,2:28:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's this box-like shape with a rim,
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.32,2:28:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's like a TV or a toaster-
Dialogue: 0,2:28:28.36,2:28:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Toaster? Slots like these, hmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:28.35,2:28:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, exactly, he's pretty toaster-ish.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.78,2:28:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:31.45,2:28:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-So that's... bread that's sticking out?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.15,2:28:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]\N-[audience laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.96,2:28:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see. Bread sticking out horizontally.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.30,2:28:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:37.64,2:28:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-sanshin na ???
Dialogue: 0,2:28:38.17,2:28:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-???, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:40.30,2:28:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-So uh, is Balrog a living thing, or a machine?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:43.15,2:28:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Tough question...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:44.44,2:28:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from abroad depicted him as a machine, and showed me...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.12,2:28:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:49.58,2:28:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I was like, Hmm, so that's what he's like...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.44,2:28:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:28:52.75,2:28:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-It was a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:53.69,2:28:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.97,2:28:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's soap, so it's probably not like that...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:57.44,2:29:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,As the creator, I can't be accepting other people's fixes for my incomplete work.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:02.11,2:29:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:02.97,2:29:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:03.88,2:29:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:04.67,2:29:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, on to #2...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.67,2:29:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And #2 is...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:09.31,2:29:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sue.\N-Sue...\N-Ah, Sue...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:11.34,2:29:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, part of the three-way battle...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:12.19,2:29:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-The three-way...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:13.21,2:29:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:13.87,2:29:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-What about Toroko?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.80,2:29:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, Toroko's not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.80,2:29:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Toroko showed up earlier as an enemy character...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:19.32,2:29:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-uchi ni shou nagareta janai desu ka ne
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.80,2:29:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? Toroko...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.48,2:29:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think a lot of people like Toroko.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.52,2:29:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, true.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:26.28,2:29:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-But she hasn't shown up yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.02,2:29:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, I think it was like,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.02,2:29:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.33,2:29:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sue was originally the heroine, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.45,2:29:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're right, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:34.83,2:29:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Curly, rather, Sue used to be the main heroine.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.77,2:29:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sue was, um...
Dialogue: 0,2:29:38.33,2:29:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, the protagonist was the player themself.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:41.12,2:29:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But then there's a someone who actually progresses the story - that was Sue.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.54,2:29:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:45.05,2:29:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And she stumbles around as she tries to find an exit to the cave.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:48.83,2:29:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In this setting too, she was a mimiga who didn't get along very well with other mimiga.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:54.14,2:29:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, part of those characteristics remained in Curly Brace.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.91,2:29:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.68,2:30:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she's still kind of the main heroine, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:02.04,2:30:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, in a sense.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:03.90,2:30:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.96,2:30:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, Sue's a good character.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:06.60,2:30:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-She is.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:07.21,2:30:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sue de ko nanika ni mezameta mitai na hito mo ???
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.39,2:30:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-What was that?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.39,2:30:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-[muttering]
Dialogue: 0,2:30:11.66,2:30:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Haha, alright, I get it,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:14.04,2:30:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,let's move on?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:14.89,2:30:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, haha, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.96,2:30:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes please.\N-Alright then, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:18.67,2:30:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for #1...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:19.77,2:30:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Drumroll again, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:21.07,2:30:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Drumroll, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.54,2:30:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[Drum roll]
Dialogue: 0,2:30:28.32,2:30:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, coming in at #1 in Cave Story's Character popularity poll is...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:31.71,2:30:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This character:
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.94,2:30:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:33.58,2:30:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[applause]
Dialogue: 0,2:30:38.97,2:30:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-More "Ah" than "Oh", wouldn't you say.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:40.83,2:30:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.36,2:30:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:42.65,2:30:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, this was pretty much expected, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:44.92,2:30:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:46.32,2:30:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Y'know, it was a real shock in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.62,2:30:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time I finished the game.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.12,2:30:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ahh, when you don't save - uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.84,2:30:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The scene where the Island's going down,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:54.70,2:30:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.16,2:30:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Camera panning across, indifferently... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:56.75,2:30:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, was there such a scene?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.49,2:30:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.05,2:31:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, if you don't save her, that'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:01.50,2:31:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:00.33,2:31:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, if you don't save her,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:02.25,2:31:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,then moving forward, it shows various stages,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:05.02,2:31:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,all shaking due to the earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.15,2:31:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And in there, you also see Curly, who's collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:10.12,2:31:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.61,2:31:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.01,2:31:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-I mean, now that I think about it, it's pretty wicked.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.38,2:31:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the scene with Toroko, then Curly...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:17.34,2:31:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,First we can't save her,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:19.23,2:31:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we can only stand there, shocked, before moving on,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:22.04,2:31:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, even the Island falls...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.17,2:31:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, when I... When this event came around,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:27.45,2:31:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't clear it.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.46,2:31:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:29.13,2:31:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now, I tried my best,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:30.68,2:31:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.29,2:31:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and after she collapsed,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.44,2:31:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I moved a little to the left, and the shutter came down,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.01,2:31:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was like, Whoops, left her behind...
Dialogue: 0,2:31:37.63,2:31:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.42,2:31:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-I didn't follow up on that,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:41.23,2:31:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and left that place.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.08,2:31:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure I could go on ahead, and then come back later to save her.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.43,2:31:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yep, yep, I thought that would happen later, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:48.80,2:31:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-bei ending mukaichaimashita ne ano mama akarui ending wo ???
Dialogue: 0,2:31:52.40,2:31:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah... I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.92,2:31:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.92,2:31:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's true, there's a bit too many deaths.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:57.66,2:32:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a lot of criticism about this, ano game sunizugi??? deru tte tashikani
Dialogue: 0,2:32:01.40,2:32:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,atosaki kangaezu ni shinanyoukun??? darou kou nacchatta mitai na
Dialogue: 0,2:32:05.08,2:32:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:06.00,2:32:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,arimashita curly brace tte...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.20,2:32:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-At first, however,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.89,2:32:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the True Ending route wasn't there yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:11.71,2:32:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, that came at the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:13.40,2:32:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But, in the debugging bulletin board,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:15.96,2:32:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...redevelopment? No, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.27,2:32:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,before they told me to make an ending where you can save Curly,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:23.44,2:32:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,they were like, it's not so great that the Island has to fall apart completely...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.66,2:32:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:28.27,2:32:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-abunai koto wo iuteru no ga debaka??? ni omotte
Dialogue: 0,2:32:30.80,2:32:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-ah demo s- omae ga yaritai koto wa sore chigainai toka yokatta
Dialogue: 0,2:32:33.82,2:32:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-sou, sou ??? ni ne
Dialogue: 0,2:32:36.67,2:32:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-ah chotto kangaete dakedo ottette
Dialogue: 0,2:32:38.68,2:32:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-isshun de
Dialogue: 0,2:32:39.90,2:32:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-ah sou desu ne, hai
Dialogue: 0,2:32:41.56,2:32:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, tokuhyou su de iu to
Dialogue: 0,2:32:44.35,2:32:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,eh, mitsudomoe no baisko ga
Dialogue: 0,2:32:48.20,2:32:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-dantotsu tte koto desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.84,2:32:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-dantotsu shita ne yappari ne
Dialogue: 0,2:32:51.37,2:32:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-souida
Dialogue: 0,2:32:52.03,2:32:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-mitsudomoe ni hairanakatta
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.50,2:32:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Curly Brace also has scenes where you fight together with her.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.41,2:32:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-True. In the comments too,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:58.52,2:33:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"That camaraderie of fighting together is nice", they were saying.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:02.17,2:33:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,kouka okatta character desu ne
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.17,2:33:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, but that scene is in the end, like in the very end, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:09.07,2:33:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:09.90,2:33:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-As far as heroine characters go, she's introduced pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:12.80,2:33:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-True, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.44,2:33:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-The tension is high.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:14.89,2:33:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-She moves around a lot when she's following along.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:17.12,2:33:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.\N-Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:18.27,2:33:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-I would try and dash off ahead on my own.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.38,2:33:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:21.32,2:33:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:21.96,2:33:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In videos, too, you see Curly being made to fight basically by herself...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:26.01,2:33:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-hoka ni, tatoeba ninki no ato character toka wa dou deshita ka
Dialogue: 0,2:33:26.78,2:33:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.52,2:33:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.56,2:33:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,iu to irun desu keredo mo
Dialogue: 0,2:33:32.88,2:33:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah?\N-But..
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.60,2:33:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,ageru to kiki ga naku naru sou nano de
Dialogue: 0,2:33:35.60,2:33:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,chotto kore wa mata dokka betsu na kikai de
Dialogue: 0,2:33:38.00,2:33:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So uh, I thought we'd do the official announcement.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:40.54,2:33:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Alright, let's go with that.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.63,2:33:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-sou yo otanoshimii to iu kanji ni ishitada kereba na to omoimasu ne
Dialogue: 0,2:33:44.94,2:33:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-So on that note, I think now, the popularity poll is
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.10,2:33:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,is wrapping up, so we will bring that to a close.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:52.35,2:33:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With that said, I think we're at a good point in time,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:55.58,2:33:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,finally we have one more,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:56.84,2:33:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.90,2:33:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,there's one more thing to unveil today.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:00.56,2:34:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakamura-san?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:01.63,2:34:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, uh, we do.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:03.76,2:34:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-So... We're good to reveal this now, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:05.48,2:34:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:06.44,2:34:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, uh, the DSiWare version's relea-
Dialogue: 0,2:34:09.74,2:34:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, the release of the remastered version,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:13.26,2:34:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In connection with that, an official site has been set up.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:15.69,2:34:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.25,2:34:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So with that, the limited release is-
Dialogue: 0,2:34:19.26,2:34:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is just going to take a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:21.37,2:34:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ok.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:21.79,2:34:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:22.11,2:34:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the site that we caught a peek of earlier,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:24.75,2:34:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:25.85,2:34:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,let's have Nakamura-san show it to us.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:28.11,2:34:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yup.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:28.96,2:34:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a moment...
Dialogue: 0,2:34:31.29,2:34:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-It says "Official Site Opening" there on top?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:33.23,2:34:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:33.88,2:34:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The official site will be handled like, for example,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.88,2:34:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,a continuation of the popularity poll?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:38.68,2:34:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, I think that would be good, if we can.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.16,2:34:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.65,2:34:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, well then, let's enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.48,2:34:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right. So what we see here is, uh,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.52,2:34:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,this is Cave Story's official site.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:47.21,2:34:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is the admin screen,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.84,2:34:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,uhh,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.66,2:34:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to get into kankidashi???
Dialogue: 0,2:34:51.34,2:34:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,mi ni ???masen keredo mo
Dialogue: 0,2:34:53.56,2:34:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, now, Cave Story has an amazing fanart scene,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:57.66,2:34:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,eh, uchi no naramura to iro to shite mashite
Dialogue: 0,2:35:00.54,2:35:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and I/he was like, what do you think of this, and uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:02.35,2:35:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Um,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.08,2:35:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cave Story is, after all, popular as a retro game,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:06.72,2:35:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and it was made in pixel art,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:06.75,2:35:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:09.61,2:35:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and well, lately, you're seeing that if a game is pixel art, its homepage will be pixel art too,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.67,2:35:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hm, true.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:15.34,2:35:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, well,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:16.64,2:35:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like most of the pe... like those who are here with us today,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:19.39,2:35:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I played Cave Story once fairly long ago,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:23.55,2:35:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and then hearing it's coming out on DSi, I thought I'd try playing it again...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:26.97,2:35:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:27.79,2:35:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the music started playing in this part here, the memories came rushing back,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:31.71,2:35:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,saisho ni omise shita movie nanka mo
Dialogue: 0,2:35:34.17,2:35:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,dsi deta kara konya chotto tetsuya de yatte miyou ka tte iu na ???
Dialogue: 0,2:35:37.88,2:35:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah.\N-Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:38.97,2:35:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bed no ue de yattemashita ne? Tashikani.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:39.93,2:35:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.50,2:35:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-??? desu yo ne?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.67,2:35:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-And the site itself,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:44.70,2:35:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,apart from using pixel art...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.15,2:35:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...can you... uh, go down?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:48.36,2:35:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Scroll?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.76,2:35:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:51.61,2:35:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Cool.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:52.16,2:35:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-So you see this picture of Curly here,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:54.75,2:35:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,we thought we'd gather and collect fanart like that,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:57.39,2:36:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and thus make a site that was built by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:00.16,2:36:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:01.36,2:36:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this lettering that says "Fanart" and "Software Info",
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.15,2:36:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that was drawn by Amaya-san.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:06.91,2:36:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, Amaya-san drew this?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.08,2:36:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.81,2:36:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.14,2:36:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,For the fanart section here,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:11.88,2:36:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,was there a user-submission entry form, like with this event?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:15.47,2:36:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right, about that...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:16.28,2:36:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-So, I had wanted to implement that if possible,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.49,2:36:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:19.50,2:36:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the kokkyoka??? wasn't available to everyone,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:22.27,2:36:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and then contacting people individually...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.20,2:36:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,ma kaijakute??? irassharu kata de
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.11,2:36:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,ato de o hanasu deki areba, ano, sono toki demo hanashi itadakeraba na to omotte irimasu
Dialogue: 0,2:36:30.04,2:36:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-I do think we should continue accepting entries on this site, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:34.91,2:36:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let's have a look at the other pages...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.24,2:36:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.59,2:36:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-I've been wanting to look at this too, actually...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.60,2:36:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, hand-drawn illustrations...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.81,2:36:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.14,2:36:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Amaya-san drew these...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.50,2:36:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I drew them, and then...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:47.50,2:36:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I had Naramura-san make them pretty.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.65,2:36:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,2:36:51.90,2:36:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:52.68,2:36:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-So...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.76,2:36:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who made the illustrations,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.91,2:37:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:01.39,2:37:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:03.80,2:37:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but this was drawn by the creator himself,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:06.14,2:37:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so this is official.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.44,2:37:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.88,2:37:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't do 3d modeling...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.49,2:37:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Isn't the text... kinda weird?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:14.81,2:37:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, the text...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:15.92,2:37:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-???
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.67,2:37:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, I tried to make it "in that style"...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.26,2:37:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-"In that style"?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.28,2:37:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-But it got all messy...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.68,2:37:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[laughter]
Dialogue: 0,2:37:24.88,2:37:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:25.40,2:37:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-janki wa robot yabawi???-
Dialogue: 0,2:37:27.50,2:37:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,2:37:28.68,2:37:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-???\N-mimi deshou???
Dialogue: 0,2:37:29.93,2:37:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,mimi nattemasu ne
Dialogue: 0,2:37:31.13,2:37:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-???
Dialogue: 0,2:37:33.79,2:37:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-maa fun'iki toshite wa konna... hai
Dialogue: 0,2:37:34.19,2:37:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-"In that style"...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:35.45,2:37:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-shigoto kara ne,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:36.75,2:37:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,those who worked on the WiiWare site would know,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:38.83,2:37:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,koi dame teki surenai to, kankaku wakannai n desu yo ne
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.92,2:37:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,de maa, kou iu no, eh, shikakete...ru wake nan desu ne
Dialogue: 0,2:37:44.97,2:37:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.95,2:37:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-About this, also,
